(674969, 70307, 6025, '<td valign="top">I think this may well be a winner. The high contrast and dramatic angle is quite stunning. Not sure if it fully follows the challenge, but I am voting it a straight 10 anyway. Absolutely gorgeous.</td>', 'I think this may well be a winner. The high contrast and dramatic angle is quite stunning. Not sure if it fully follows the challenge, but I am voting it a straight 10 anyway. Absolutely gorgeous.', '2004-04-19 05:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
