(674976, 69943, 6025, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is very lord of the rings-esque. If you have a look at their tail and the top of the bodies, it looks as if it has been over-sharpened quite a bit. Not that it really matters, the picture works perfectly (9)</td>', 'The lighting in this is very lord of the rings-esque. If you have a look at their tail and the top of the bodies, it looks as if it has been over-sharpened quite a bit. Not that it really matters, the picture works perfectly (9)', '2004-04-19 05:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(674978, 70903, 6025, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, but the whole picture seems a bit too dark, and you could have increased the contrast on the wire a bit, to make it completely black. Otherwise: quite a shot! (9)</td>', 'Gorgeous, but the whole picture seems a bit too dark, and you could have increased the contrast on the wire a bit, to make it completely black. Otherwise: quite a shot! (9)', '2004-04-19 05:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
