(674986, 70503, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the inclusion of two balloons rather than one - really makes it more striking. In terms of composition, given that there isn''t really much more sky than there is water I''d crop the sky down and opt for a centred horizon. Ideally I''d suggest having a touch more sky than you have (to create a one third/ two thirds balance) and I''d also rotate to the right a touch so that the balloons are a touch further left within the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the inclusion of two balloons rather than one - really makes it more striking. In terms of composition, given that there isn''t really much more sky than there is water I''d crop the sky down and opt for a centred horizon. Ideally I''d suggest having a touch more sky than you have (to create a one third/ two thirds balance) and I''d also rotate to the right a touch so that the balloons are a touch further left within the frame.', '2004-04-19 05:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(674987, 70568, 17033, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid you''re stuck here....the subject matter/title/emotion requires us to see her face but then this is a silhouette challenge...it looks almost sinister at the moment...or even insulting as a wedding pic!!</td>', 'I''m afraid you''re stuck here....the subject matter/title/emotion requires us to see her face but then this is a silhouette challenge...it looks almost sinister at the moment...or even insulting as a wedding pic!!', '2004-04-19 05:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(674988, 70568, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I see this as a silhouette - it strikes me more as a badly exposed frontal portrait which woujld be better with fill-in light to show her expression than it is with her face and upper torso blacked out. A beautiful composition though.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I see this as a silhouette - it strikes me more as a badly exposed frontal portrait which woujld be better with fill-in light to show her expression than it is with her face and upper torso blacked out. A beautiful composition though.', '2004-04-19 05:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674990, 70616, 17033, '<td valign="top">Brilliant compsition...top two at the moment. Not sure the red eyes add though!</td>', 'Brilliant compsition...top two at the moment. Not sure the red eyes add though!', '2004-04-19 05:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
