(675050, 70642, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful choice of subject matter and the morning mist just compliments it perfectly. Composition doesn''t work so well for me - because the two boats are not symmetrical anyway I think it would be better to have them as a whole centred within the watery background. Alternatively the extra space would work better for me above and to the right of the boats - perhaps because of the direction of the body of that man with his pole? Still one of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful choice of subject matter and the morning mist just compliments it perfectly. Composition doesn''t work so well for me - because the two boats are not symmetrical anyway I think it would be better to have them as a whole centred within the watery background. Alternatively the extra space would work better for me above and to the right of the boats - perhaps because of the direction of the body of that man with his pole? Still one of my favourites in this challenge.', '2004-04-19 06:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
