(675387, 70503, 14603, '<td valign="top">What luck to have these as subjects and the weather obliging too.<br/>You certainly have made the most of it with an excellent image.</td>', 'What luck to have these as subjects and the weather obliging too.You certainly have made the most of it with an excellent image.', '2004-04-19 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
