(675393, 70935, 18897, '<td valign="top">Ok, rules revisited: ''Silhouettes are created by backlit subjects, which causes them to appear solid and without much detail''.<br/> <br/>Now, looking at this picture, take the words ''soft'' and ''solid'' and have to remove one. Left with ''solid''? Didn''t think so.<br/> <br/>I love it! :-)</td>', 'Ok, rules revisited: ''Silhouettes are created by backlit subjects, which causes them to appear solid and without much detail''. Now, looking at this picture, take the words ''soft'' and ''solid'' and have to remove one. Left with ''solid''? Didn''t think so. I love it! :-)', '2004-04-19 11:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(675395, 70934, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and good colour</td>', 'Nicely composed and good colour', '2004-04-19 11:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(675399, 70904, 4285, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get a lot of this but, to me, this is, by no stretch of the imagination, a silhouette. Only fair to let you know why I gave it a 1.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get a lot of this but, to me, this is, by no stretch of the imagination, a silhouette. Only fair to let you know why I gave it a 1.', '2004-04-19 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
