(675406, 70724, 4285, '<td valign="top">A picture of a dog and his shadow run through "art" filters or whatever isn''t a silhouette IMHO. Only fair to say why I gave it a 1.</td>', 'A picture of a dog and his shadow run through "art" filters or whatever isn''t a silhouette IMHO. Only fair to say why I gave it a 1.', '2004-04-19 12:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
