(675408, 70911, 327, '<td valign="top">Clear clean shot. I think the contrail on the left could go....it pulls the eye from the tree the main subject. Not adding to the over all photo. Good entry, hope you do well.</td>', 'Clear clean shot. I think the contrail on the left could go....it pulls the eye from the tree the main subject. Not adding to the over all photo. Good entry, hope you do well.', '2004-04-19 12:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(675414, 70916, 4285, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this isn''t a very good example of silhouette. If you had taken the picture at a time of the day when the sun was shining on the opposite side of the statue then you could have achieved a nice silhouette effect. Otherwise it is composed fairly well and the negative space could have worked well. Only fair to say why I gave it a 2.</td>', 'Sorry but this isn''t a very good example of silhouette. If you had taken the picture at a time of the day when the sun was shining on the opposite side of the statue then you could have achieved a nice silhouette effect. Otherwise it is composed fairly well and the negative space could have worked well. Only fair to say why I gave it a 2.', '2004-04-19 12:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(675418, 70917, 327, '<td valign="top">Horton hears a HOO! LOL Funny you thought of that. Your right of course. :)  Stunning blue sky there. 100% on topic for the challenge. Good entry.</td>', 'Horton hears a HOO! LOL Funny you thought of that. Your right of course. :)  Stunning blue sky there. 100% on topic for the challenge. Good entry.', '2004-04-19 12:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
