(675734, 70928, 18194, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, but it looks like it may be suffering from editing artifacts.  The color that is in coming through the bush to the right of the golfer look very odd.</td>', 'A very nice photo, but it looks like it may be suffering from editing artifacts.  The color that is in coming through the bush to the right of the golfer look very odd.', '2004-04-19 15:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(675735, 70434, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  In this case I don''t think the black border adds anything.  Nice rom lighting on the head.</td>', 'Nicely done.  In this case I don''t think the black border adds anything.  Nice rom lighting on the head.', '2004-04-19 15:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(675736, 70298, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Magical.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Magical.', '2004-04-19 15:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(675739, 70959, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not strong as a silhouette.  NIce shapes and patterns.</td>', 'Not strong as a silhouette.  NIce shapes and patterns.', '2004-04-19 15:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(675740, 70132, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but it doesn''t have much impact for me.</td>', 'Nice idea but it doesn''t have much impact for me.', '2004-04-19 15:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(675741, 70771, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice use of repeating shapes, very graphic.</td>', 'Nice use of repeating shapes, very graphic.', '2004-04-19 15:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(675743, 70573, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice job of composing.  Mysterious and plain fun.</td>', 'Very nice job of composing.  Mysterious and plain fun.', '2004-04-19 15:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(675745, 70902, 19608, '<td valign="top">Barn is in perfect condition for this shot.  Colors a bit unnatural which makes me score it down.</td>', 'Barn is in perfect condition for this shot.  Colors a bit unnatural which makes me score it down.', '2004-04-19 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(675749, 70734, 18194, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, the red in the sky does look a bit painted..6</td>', 'A nice photo, the red in the sky does look a bit painted..6', '2004-04-19 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(675750, 70820, 19608, '<td valign="top">Blue against the black is very nice.  Don''t like the black border.  Reflection on the front of the statue a bit bright and detract.</td>', 'Blue against the black is very nice.  Don''t like the black border.  Reflection on the front of the statue a bit bright and detract.', '2004-04-19 15:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(675754, 70702, 18194, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot...8</td>', 'I like this a lot...8', '2004-04-19 15:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(675755, 70958, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very busy and difficult to read.  The actual image is only about 10 percent of the material.  Title mispelling does not add a thing.</td>', 'Very busy and difficult to read.  The actual image is only about 10 percent of the material.  Title mispelling does not add a thing.', '2004-04-19 15:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(675757, 70959, 18194, '<td valign="top">Silhouette does not come to mind in the photo.</td>', 'Silhouette does not come to mind in the photo.', '2004-04-19 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(675758, 70725, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very special atmosphere. Was this under moonlight ? I first did not notice the two persons, they add a good sense of scale. I would have edited out the four black dots in the sky.</td>', 'Very special atmosphere. Was this under moonlight ? I first did not notice the two persons, they add a good sense of scale. I would have edited out the four black dots in the sky.', '2004-04-19 15:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(675765, 69936, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great interaction between the two models.  Way too centered, try placing the sun in nearly the top left corner (leave a bit of breathing room.)</td>', 'Great interaction between the two models.  Way too centered, try placing the sun in nearly the top left corner (leave a bit of breathing room.)', '2004-04-19 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(675766, 70639, 18194, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if this is suppose to be a parity or not.  Either way it does not do a lot for me.</td>', 'I am not sure if this is suppose to be a parity or not.  Either way it does not do a lot for me.', '2004-04-19 15:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(675767, 70300, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Colors work well.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Colors work well.', '2004-04-19 15:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(675768, 70503, 18194, '<td valign="top">Very nice..9</td>', 'Very nice..9', '2004-04-19 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(675770, 70896, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Image seems pretty static.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Image seems pretty static.', '2004-04-19 15:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(675773, 70626, 19608, '<td valign="top">Waterline is very nice.  Colors really pop. The title does nothing for me at all.</td>', 'Waterline is very nice.  Colors really pop. The title does nothing for me at all.', '2004-04-19 15:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(675774, 70858, 18194, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I like the unnatural look to this.</td>', 'I am not sure I like the unnatural look to this.', '2004-04-19 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
