(676097, 70719, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Placement of the human figures perfect.  Not sure I like the tree shapes.  Could crop from the top a bit (about half the distance from the top of the left side to the dark shape.)</td>', 'Nice composition.  Placement of the human figures perfect.  Not sure I like the tree shapes.  Could crop from the top a bit (about half the distance from the top of the left side to the dark shape.)', '2004-04-19 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
