(676683, 70471, 327, '<td valign="top">This is not bad. It is boring. I don''t see much here except for a lot of noise. Maybe compression? The type of light? or the shutter speed. I''m not sure.  I don''t want to make you feel as if I''m trashing this shot.....no. Just expressing that this needed a bit more to it.</td>', 'This is not bad. It is boring. I don''t see much here except for a lot of noise. Maybe compression? The type of light? or the shutter speed. I''m not sure.  I don''t want to make you feel as if I''m trashing this shot.....no. Just expressing that this needed a bit more to it.', '2004-04-20 00:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(676684, 70701, 18403, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a longer exposure would bring out the silhouettes better, or levels adjustment possibly.</td>', 'Perhaps a longer exposure would bring out the silhouettes better, or levels adjustment possibly.', '2004-04-20 00:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(676686, 70724, 327, '<td valign="top">Painterly affect is okay, but a bit over done for my taste. I don''t dislike it totally.</td>', 'Painterly affect is okay, but a bit over done for my taste. I don''t dislike it totally.', '2004-04-20 00:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(676687, 70420, 327, '<td valign="top">Painful on the eyes! Yikes. Little too bright. :)</td>', 'Painful on the eyes! Yikes. Little too bright. :)', '2004-04-20 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(676695, 70265, 18403, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus, was the wind blowing the tree branches?</td>', 'Seems out of focus, was the wind blowing the tree branches?', '2004-04-20 00:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(676696, 70712, 18403, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2004-04-20 00:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(676700, 70298, 12735, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot :D</td>', 'beautiful shot :D', '2004-04-20 00:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(676719, 70570, 18403, '<td valign="top">Shades of a soap opera! (pun intended!) Lovely composition.</td>', 'Shades of a soap opera! (pun intended!) Lovely composition.', '2004-04-20 00:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(676729, 70801, 12252, '<td valign="top">Haunting. Love the photo, love the frame.</td>', 'Haunting. Love the photo, love the frame.', '2004-04-20 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(676733, 70828, 12252, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. Is it tilted to the right?</td>', 'Lovely picture. Is it tilted to the right?', '2004-04-20 01:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(676735, 70862, 12252, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but isn''t particularly holding my interest, FWIW.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but isn''t particularly holding my interest, FWIW.', '2004-04-20 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(676737, 70616, 12252, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC! Don''t you wish I could vote? You''d have (another) ten. Know why? The RED! The RED! It makes this picture exceptional.</td>', 'FANTASTIC! Don''t you wish I could vote? You''d have (another) ten. Know why? The RED! The RED! It makes this picture exceptional.', '2004-04-20 01:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(676738, 70503, 772, '<td valign="top">This is just simply peaceful to look at.  I can almost imagine myself sitting on a dock on the lake and being witness to something like this.  It feels ''silent''.  The color of the light also feels very warm.  I might even have my fishing pole with me when I see this.  I like this composition with the sun behind the baloon.  That contributes nicely to the silhouette.  This is a great example of being ready to go and in the right place at the right time.  <br/> <br/>Compositionally, I think you have a couple options here that could create an even stronger image.  This one feels somewhat ''static'' because the horizon is splitting near the center of the frame, and the balloons with their reflections are creating a centered vertical, but slightly off balance.  I think a simple tighter crop here would work nicely.  Make it into a tall narrow compostion just large enough to encompass the balloons with their reflections....<br/> <br/>Excellent work :)</td>', 'This is just simply peaceful to look at.  I can almost imagine myself sitting on a dock on the lake and being witness to something like this.  It feels ''silent''.  The color of the light also feels very warm.  I might even have my fishing pole with me when I see this.  I like this composition with the sun behind the baloon.  That contributes nicely to the silhouette.  This is a great example of being ready to go and in the right place at the right time.   Compositionally, I think you have a couple options here that could create an even stronger image.  This one feels somewhat ''static'' because the horizon is splitting near the center of the frame, and the balloons with their reflections are creating a centered vertical, but slightly off balance.  I think a simple tighter crop here would work nicely.  Make it into a tall narrow compostion just large enough to encompass the balloons with their reflections.... Excellent work :)', '2004-04-20 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(676740, 70486, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would have skewed the picture so the flagpole was perpendicular to the horizon, and cropped more off the bottom.</td>', 'Nice, but I would have skewed the picture so the flagpole was perpendicular to the horizon, and cropped more off the bottom.', '2004-04-20 01:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(676742, 70918, 12252, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm... Very nice. Just the right amount of silhouetting. I can''t decide if I like the tilt or not. I think I do. I also like how she''s sort of looking back, not at the camera (or the off-picture subject)</td>', 'Mmmmm... Very nice. Just the right amount of silhouetting. I can''t decide if I like the tilt or not. I think I do. I also like how she''s sort of looking back, not at the camera (or the off-picture subject)', '2004-04-20 01:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(676745, 70928, 12252, '<td valign="top">A shot every golfer would enjoy. My nits: the shoes are sort of glowing on my monitor, and the sun loks blue in the middle of the bush/tree.</td>', 'A shot every golfer would enjoy. My nits: the shoes are sort of glowing on my monitor, and the sun loks blue in the middle of the bush/tree.', '2004-04-20 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(676748, 70697, 12252, '<td valign="top">I wish the sky was just a tad darker or more dramatic. I''m not able to vote, but I would have given this a 5. Meets the challenge without a doubt. Just not THAT interesting, to ME.</td>', 'I wish the sky was just a tad darker or more dramatic. I''m not able to vote, but I would have given this a 5. Meets the challenge without a doubt. Just not THAT interesting, to ME.', '2004-04-20 01:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(676751, 70953, 12252, '<td valign="top">The top part of the background is distracting, and the shoes seem to be out of focus. The glare on the table (?) floor (?) is a bit too much as well. Last, I think you cropped too much off the top of the shoes.</td>', 'The top part of the background is distracting, and the shoes seem to be out of focus. The glare on the table (?) floor (?) is a bit too much as well. Last, I think you cropped too much off the top of the shoes.', '2004-04-20 01:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(676753, 70239, 12252, '<td valign="top">I loved this as a thumbnail, but not as much in real size. I don''t like how the shadow turned out, and I think the frame is WAY to thick. Perhaps frame it the width of the stool or stepladder. Seems a bit noisy perhaps? The pose is good. Worth further exploration, if you''re so inclined...</td>', 'I loved this as a thumbnail, but not as much in real size. I don''t like how the shadow turned out, and I think the frame is WAY to thick. Perhaps frame it the width of the stool or stepladder. Seems a bit noisy perhaps? The pose is good. Worth further exploration, if you''re so inclined...', '2004-04-20 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(676754, 70511, 12252, '<td valign="top">Dramatic but the bridge seems just slightly out of focus. Otherwise very interesting shot.</td>', 'Dramatic but the bridge seems just slightly out of focus. Otherwise very interesting shot.', '2004-04-20 01:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(676760, 70841, 12252, '<td valign="top">Spooky. Eerie. Well done.</td>', 'Spooky. Eerie. Well done.', '2004-04-20 01:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(676762, 70719, 772, '<td valign="top">Perspective is everything.  Including the people in this photograph create that perspective that would otherwise be gone.  The placement of the sun in this image creates a great composition, along with the diagonal... great shot :)</td>', 'Perspective is everything.  Including the people in this photograph create that perspective that would otherwise be gone.  The placement of the sun in this image creates a great composition, along with the diagonal... great shot :)', '2004-04-20 01:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(676763, 70639, 12252, '<td valign="top">Looks like a toy soldier; the framing is distracting (too thick on top and bottom). Because it''s a toy soldier, his foot looks weird standing on...what? a board? I realize it''s a piece of plastic but it distracts and gives away the image.</td>', 'Looks like a toy soldier; the framing is distracting (too thick on top and bottom). Because it''s a toy soldier, his foot looks weird standing on...what? a board? I realize it''s a piece of plastic but it distracts and gives away the image.', '2004-04-20 01:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(676765, 70671, 12252, '<td valign="top">Focus, focus, focus!</td>', 'Focus, focus, focus!', '2004-04-20 01:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(676768, 70570, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nancy, is this yours? Either way, it''s gorgeous!</td>', 'Nancy, is this yours? Either way, it''s gorgeous!', '2004-04-20 01:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(676769, 70833, 12252, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but doesn''t hold interest.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but doesn''t hold interest.', '2004-04-20 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(676772, 70819, 12252, '<td valign="top">I think this is lovely. I like the hand and think it "makes" the shot. Very pretty.</td>', 'I think this is lovely. I like the hand and think it "makes" the shot. Very pretty.', '2004-04-20 01:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(676773, 70836, 16095, '<td valign="top">beautiful-i''m sure you''ll get "too dark" comments, but i think it''s quite lovely</td>', 'beautiful-i''m sure you''ll get "too dark" comments, but i think it''s quite lovely', '2004-04-20 01:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(676774, 70953, 16095, '<td valign="top">great idea-very creative</td>', 'great idea-very creative', '2004-04-20 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(676775, 70931, 12252, '<td valign="top">So close to being a real POP picture. What gets in the way is the background shrubbery which takes away the lines of the horse. Otherwise, terrific capture! I love the lighting, the sense of motion, and the matching hair on the girl and mane on the horse. Just wish there wasn''t a tree/shrub behind them!</td>', 'So close to being a real POP picture. What gets in the way is the background shrubbery which takes away the lines of the horse. Otherwise, terrific capture! I love the lighting, the sense of motion, and the matching hair on the girl and mane on the horse. Just wish there wasn''t a tree/shrub behind them!', '2004-04-20 01:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(676777, 70708, 16095, '<td valign="top">very graphical and eye catching</td>', 'very graphical and eye catching', '2004-04-20 01:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(676779, 70129, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely moody and stark. Good capture. Thank you for not smothering it with a thick black frame!</td>', 'Nicely moody and stark. Good capture. Thank you for not smothering it with a thick black frame!', '2004-04-20 01:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(676781, 70889, 16095, '<td valign="top">you captured softness/innocence well here</td>', 'you captured softness/innocence well here', '2004-04-20 01:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(676783, 70566, 16095, '<td valign="top">you have the hands almost identical to the painting!!wow!</td>', 'you have the hands almost identical to the painting!!wow!', '2004-04-20 01:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(676784, 70568, 16095, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2004-04-20 01:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(676785, 70642, 16095, '<td valign="top">what a magnificant scene- great capture</td>', 'what a magnificant scene- great capture', '2004-04-20 01:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
