(677136, 70704, 12857, '<td valign="top">I dont know if this would be silhouetted enough for most but I love love love the composition.  On that alone it is great!!!!</td>', 'I dont know if this would be silhouetted enough for most but I love love love the composition.  On that alone it is great!!!!', '2004-04-20 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
