(677141, 70503, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot.  Great job!!</td>', 'This is a stunning shot.  Great job!!', '2004-04-20 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(677143, 70702, 772, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this image.  I enjoy an occasional trip to the coast of eastern North Carolina for some solitude and fishing.  The early morning breeze and the salt air, coupled with the relentless squawking of seagulls doesn''t sound as peaceful as it really is.  Excellent work :)</td>', 'I can relate to this image.  I enjoy an occasional trip to the coast of eastern North Carolina for some solitude and fishing.  The early morning breeze and the salt air, coupled with the relentless squawking of seagulls doesn''t sound as peaceful as it really is.  Excellent work :)', '2004-04-20 10:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(677147, 70714, 11324, '<td valign="top">Wish I could have published this when I was looking for photos of Santorini!!!  8</td>', 'Wish I could have published this when I was looking for photos of Santorini!!!  8', '2004-04-20 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(677150, 70724, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  The composition is great!  You captured the silhouette, but the texture is outstanding.  If you get a chance to email me I would love to know how you did this!!! Great job 9!!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  The composition is great!  You captured the silhouette, but the texture is outstanding.  If you get a chance to email me I would love to know how you did this!!! Great job 9!!', '2004-04-20 10:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(677153, 70573, 772, '<td valign="top">These dandilion ''pods'' have fascinated me since I was a child.  I still occasionally pick one up and give it a ''puff'' and watch the seeds float aimlessly in the breeze.  Excellent work...</td>', 'These dandilion ''pods'' have fascinated me since I was a child.  I still occasionally pick one up and give it a ''puff'' and watch the seeds float aimlessly in the breeze.  Excellent work...', '2004-04-20 10:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(677155, 70925, 8139, '<td valign="top">This is a original idea: making a silhouette from a part of ground .<br/>Great composition, beautiful B/W .Amazing sky. Simple and aestetic.<br/>My first 10 so far.<br/></td>', 'This is a original idea: making a silhouette from a part of ground .Great composition, beautiful B/W .Amazing sky. Simple and aestetic.My first 10 so far.', '2004-04-20 10:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(677161, 70503, 8139, '<td valign="top">Interesting, great colors, fits 100% the challenge. The baloons are too centered, so -2 for the composition. (8).</td>', 'Interesting, great colors, fits 100% the challenge. The baloons are too centered, so -2 for the composition. (8).', '2004-04-20 10:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(677178, 70341, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work...</td>', 'Beautiful work...', '2004-04-20 10:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(677195, 70616, 8139, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette composition. The redish electric lines and lights add to it.Shame there are two spots at left of the bird that you could clone out. 9</td>', 'Great silhouette composition. The redish electric lines and lights add to it.Shame there are two spots at left of the bird that you could clone out. 9', '2004-04-20 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(677201, 70840, 772, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the simplicity of this photo.  The minimalism here really seems to create some nice visual appeal.  Excellent work.</td>', 'I really enjoy the simplicity of this photo.  The minimalism here really seems to create some nice visual appeal.  Excellent work.', '2004-04-20 11:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
