(677259, 70935, 1793, '<td valign="top">beautiful transfer of light to dark on her body. i like the hand positions, it creates a nice flowing line from top to bottom, diagonally. <br/>i like how there is a silhouette here and yet the feeling of soft texture of the skin is given.</td>', 'beautiful transfer of light to dark on her body. i like the hand positions, it creates a nice flowing line from top to bottom, diagonally. i like how there is a silhouette here and yet the feeling of soft texture of the skin is given.', '2004-04-20 12:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(677261, 70298, 1793, '<td valign="top">i like the close up, and i like the ... softness that''s conveyed by the thin, fluffy lines. i''m not sure how silhouetty this is, however i like it.</td>', 'i like the close up, and i like the ... softness that''s conveyed by the thin, fluffy lines. i''m not sure how silhouetty this is, however i like it.', '2004-04-20 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(677265, 70302, 1793, '<td valign="top">fantastic colors and fantastic idea. i love how the bird is glancing at the other one, and your title fits perfectly. super!</td>', 'fantastic colors and fantastic idea. i love how the bird is glancing at the other one, and your title fits perfectly. super!', '2004-04-20 12:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(677268, 70268, 1793, '<td valign="top">beautiful idea! a silhouette with color!</td>', 'beautiful idea! a silhouette with color!', '2004-04-20 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(677270, 70566, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t really describe how much I like this photo in ''words''.  I am quite familiar with the Michelangelo work and this particular element of it is a strong focal point for me.   I wish I had thought of something like this on my own.  It would fit well as the ''7th'' photo in the ''creation'' series that I''m working on....Phenomenal work... = 10<br/> <br/>I also like to put ''best of show'' on one photo in each challenge, and this is that one for this week... kudos :)<br/></td>', 'I can''t really describe how much I like this photo in ''words''.  I am quite familiar with the Michelangelo work and this particular element of it is a strong focal point for me.   I wish I had thought of something like this on my own.  It would fit well as the ''7th'' photo in the ''creation'' series that I''m working on....Phenomenal work... = 10 I also like to put ''best of show'' on one photo in each challenge, and this is that one for this week... kudos :)', '2004-04-20 12:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(677271, 70382, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong image in terms of the silouhettes and long shadows it presents. It is visually interesting but it also tells a story. This guy (and perhaps the photographer) are on a road trip that will include some biking (maybe in some difficult terrains?). They are fueling up for a long, possibly dangerous trek. I like the nearly monochromatic feel of the image. The only spots of color are in the faded blue of the sky and the yellow of the graffiti on the side of the VW bus.</td>', 'This is a very strong image in terms of the silouhettes and long shadows it presents. It is visually interesting but it also tells a story. This guy (and perhaps the photographer) are on a road trip that will include some biking (maybe in some difficult terrains?). They are fueling up for a long, possibly dangerous trek. I like the nearly monochromatic feel of the image. The only spots of color are in the faded blue of the sky and the yellow of the graffiti on the side of the VW bus.', '2004-04-20 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(677302, 70649, 16862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful  A wery strong impact</td>', 'Beautiful  A wery strong impact', '2004-04-20 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(677305, 70783, 4008, '<td valign="top">Silhouette ? Update after your P.M. : yes, agree, you have some dark shadow area''s without details/color (the head and part of the wing), but still my opinion is that this is far from a silhouette. The duck is mostly well lit in my opinion.  Nevertheless a very good catch, tack sharp and nice blurred background.</td>', 'Silhouette ? Update after your P.M. : yes, agree, you have some dark shadow area''s without details/color (the head and part of the wing), but still my opinion is that this is far from a silhouette. The duck is mostly well lit in my opinion.  Nevertheless a very good catch, tack sharp and nice blurred background.', '2004-04-20 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(677337, 70904, 4767, '<td valign="top">Stretch my imagination as I may, I don''t think this is a silhouette.  If it''s NOT neon, email me and I''ll raise my score.</td>', 'Stretch my imagination as I may, I don''t think this is a silhouette.  If it''s NOT neon, email me and I''ll raise my score.', '2004-04-20 13:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(677386, 70649, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic! I love that you left some ligh on the silhouette. Superb work.</td>', 'Very dramatic! I love that you left some ligh on the silhouette. Superb work.', '2004-04-20 13:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(677392, 70840, 10985, '<td valign="top">Well done and fun. I would crop out half of the top negative space.</td>', 'Well done and fun. I would crop out half of the top negative space.', '2004-04-20 13:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(677396, 70918, 10985, '<td valign="top">The silhouette itself is well done. I especially like the translucent nighty. But I would have considered using a different room in the bg, because the details there attract as much attention (because they are the only detailed parts of the photo) as the model. The shiny band at her feet is distracting, too, as are her glasses (she looks like she''s wearing glasses).</td>', 'The silhouette itself is well done. I especially like the translucent nighty. But I would have considered using a different room in the bg, because the details there attract as much attention (because they are the only detailed parts of the photo) as the model. The shiny band at her feet is distracting, too, as are her glasses (she looks like she''s wearing glasses).', '2004-04-20 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
