(678165, 70252, 13390, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky! This shot works really well for several reasons:<br/>1. The car<br/>2. The person on the bike<br/>The person on the bike really adds to the effect of size, the car also serves this smae purpose. I do feel, however, that the crop is a little too tight on the left. Personally, I would have liked to see a little more space by the biker, preferably the same as the right side, this would help balance the shot. Otherwise this is a nicely done shot and should do well. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful sky! This shot works really well for several reasons:1. The car2. The person on the bikeThe person on the bike really adds to the effect of size, the car also serves this smae purpose. I do feel, however, that the crop is a little too tight on the left. Personally, I would have liked to see a little more space by the biker, preferably the same as the right side, this would help balance the shot. Otherwise this is a nicely done shot and should do well. Good luck!', '2004-04-20 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
