(678578, 70918, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally comment on titles and am by no means a Shakespear authority, but the correct quote is ''Wherefore art thou Romeo?'' which translates into todays english to mean why did you have to be Romeo and not someone else...  Nice shot btw!  Love the white balance and the just right, subtle detail in the girls baby-doll nightie!  Just not fitting of the title.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t normally comment on titles and am by no means a Shakespear authority, but the correct quote is ''Wherefore art thou Romeo?'' which translates into todays english to mean why did you have to be Romeo and not someone else...  Nice shot btw!  Love the white balance and the just right, subtle detail in the girls baby-doll nightie!  Just not fitting of the title.TC', '2004-04-21 02:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
