(678593, 70610, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO the bottom lines are not needed elements and detract from the true subject of the shot.  Without them you have a much cleaner and more impactful composition!<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO the bottom lines are not needed elements and detract from the true subject of the shot.  Without them you have a much cleaner and more impactful composition!TC', '2004-04-21 02:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(678598, 70341, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be an incredible shot at 8x10.  At this resolution it looks a little soft (or oversharpened but I think it''s soft) and loses some of it''s pop.<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be an incredible shot at 8x10.  At this resolution it looks a little soft (or oversharpened but I think it''s soft) and loses some of it''s pop.TC', '2004-04-21 02:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
