(678769, 70698, 18722, '<td valign="top">Background too grainy and what is with the outlining?  Way too much editing of what could have been a good shot, except there does not seem to be a backlight -- unless I am missing it.</td>', 'Background too grainy and what is with the outlining?  Way too much editing of what could have been a good shot, except there does not seem to be a backlight -- unless I am missing it.', '2004-04-21 05:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
