(678790, 70745, 18722, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I care for the blue, but it is certainly striking.  I like the boiling look of the clouds.</td>', 'I am not sure I care for the blue, but it is certainly striking.  I like the boiling look of the clouds.', '2004-04-21 05:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(678791, 70773, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture.  It is too bad the water was brighter than the sky.  The water could have been taken down and the smudges taken out for a much improved image.</td>', 'Nice motion capture.  It is too bad the water was brighter than the sky.  The water could have been taken down and the smudges taken out for a much improved image.', '2004-04-21 05:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(678802, 70918, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think the backlight would have worked better if at a higher level (behind her head?)-- as it is my attention is drawn away from her and to the feet.  in portraits I prefer my attention to be drawn to the face, particularly the eyes.  While this is not strictly a portrait, I would still like to have my eyes drawn to her head.  I am not sure what I think about the tilt -- maybe she made you dizzy walking into the room like that. :D</td>', 'I think the backlight would have worked better if at a higher level (behind her head?)-- as it is my attention is drawn away from her and to the feet.  in portraits I prefer my attention to be drawn to the face, particularly the eyes.  While this is not strictly a portrait, I would still like to have my eyes drawn to her head.  I am not sure what I think about the tilt -- maybe she made you dizzy walking into the room like that. :D', '2004-04-21 05:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(678813, 70701, 18722, '<td valign="top">Would you believe it is too dark?  :D  Seriously, there is too much black for that little light.  A tighter crop would have helped drastically.</td>', 'Would you believe it is too dark?  :D  Seriously, there is too much black for that little light.  A tighter crop would have helped drastically.', '2004-04-21 05:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(678815, 70920, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice color.</td>', 'Nice color.', '2004-04-21 05:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(678818, 70914, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.  The rifle crossing the flag mast is distracting, as are the black shadows across the building (but what are you going to do?  no effect on voting).</td>', 'Nicely captured.  The rifle crossing the flag mast is distracting, as are the black shadows across the building (but what are you going to do?  no effect on voting).', '2004-04-21 05:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(678842, 70646, 8139, '<td valign="top">Dynamic ! Well composed. Great lighting. Shame for the lend glare reflections. 9</td>', 'Dynamic ! Well composed. Great lighting. Shame for the lend glare reflections. 9', '2004-04-21 06:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(678844, 70201, 8139, '<td valign="top">Smooth composition. The light colors makes the photo. The unusual framing works well here. 8</td>', 'Smooth composition. The light colors makes the photo. The unusual framing works well here. 8', '2004-04-21 06:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
