(678872, 70918, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice compo with the subject in the frame of the door. The rotation gives also a 3D sensation. Warm colors. And i imagine the story behind...</td>', 'Nice compo with the subject in the frame of the door. The rotation gives also a 3D sensation. Warm colors. And i imagine the story behind...', '2004-04-21 06:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
