(679123, 70732, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very creepy shot... effective macro with just the right amount of shadow detail. Good background. Not entirely convinced by the crop though.</td>', 'Very creepy shot... effective macro with just the right amount of shadow detail. Good background. Not entirely convinced by the crop though.', '2004-04-21 09:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(679125, 70808, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Sky seems noisy, and shot appears oversharpened. I''d have liked to see a more interesting formation of clouds. Good atmosphere though.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Sky seems noisy, and shot appears oversharpened. I''d have liked to see a more interesting formation of clouds. Good atmosphere though.', '2004-04-21 09:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(679129, 70925, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great sky, but shot doesn''t quite have enough to draw me in. Good and interesting composition.</td>', 'Great sky, but shot doesn''t quite have enough to draw me in. Good and interesting composition.', '2004-04-21 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(679130, 70724, 8522, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll find a lot of people voting badly on this one given the current digital effects backlash. I think it''s very creative using a shadow as a silhouette but I can''t understand why you''ve applied these unnecessary effects. I would say that photographic integrity has been violated here. Shame, as I like the composition.</td>', 'I think you''ll find a lot of people voting badly on this one given the current digital effects backlash. I think it''s very creative using a shadow as a silhouette but I can''t understand why you''ve applied these unnecessary effects. I would say that photographic integrity has been violated here. Shame, as I like the composition.', '2004-04-21 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(679135, 70684, 8522, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous reds, blues and yellows. I don''t think the silhouette is clean and uncluttered enough for this to be a really high-impact shot, but that is a great sky and the sun works very well.</td>', 'Gorgeous reds, blues and yellows. I don''t think the silhouette is clean and uncluttered enough for this to be a really high-impact shot, but that is a great sky and the sun works very well.', '2004-04-21 09:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(679136, 70268, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, VERY creative interpretation of challenge. Your two models are full of character and you can read all sorts of things into what each of them is thinking/feeling. Very polished execution of idea. 10/10.</td>', 'Fantastic, VERY creative interpretation of challenge. Your two models are full of character and you can read all sorts of things into what each of them is thinking/feeling. Very polished execution of idea. 10/10.', '2004-04-21 09:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(679140, 70646, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb shot, but I wonder if your monitor is calibrated badly. I feel your gamma should be a lot higher so the skateboarder''s head stands out from the sky more. Great sun flare. Good composition. Excellent timing.</td>', 'Superb shot, but I wonder if your monitor is calibrated badly. I feel your gamma should be a lot higher so the skateboarder''s head stands out from the sky more. Great sun flare. Good composition. Excellent timing.', '2004-04-21 09:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(679142, 70627, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the composition is a bit off to me. It looks like you couldn''t decide whether to centre the golfer in the frame or not. I''d crop tightly to his left, leaving plenty of negative space for him to shoot/look into. The blurred trees don''t really work for me. I''m not sure about the graduated burnt out sky behind him... it looks a tad accidental rather than planned. A great idea though, and the silhouetted pose is a good one.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the composition is a bit off to me. It looks like you couldn''t decide whether to centre the golfer in the frame or not. I''d crop tightly to his left, leaving plenty of negative space for him to shoot/look into. The blurred trees don''t really work for me. I''m not sure about the graduated burnt out sky behind him... it looks a tad accidental rather than planned. A great idea though, and the silhouetted pose is a good one.', '2004-04-21 09:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(679156, 70911, 3569, '<td valign="top">lose the contrail and ya got a winner</td>', 'lose the contrail and ya got a winner', '2004-04-21 10:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
