(679586, 70626, 7758, '<td valign="top">Best shot of the challenge in my opinion. Would like to have seen the sun lower in the sky perhaps, and may more hidden behind the clouds. The size and overexposed-ness of the sun is juuuuust a little distracting in my opinion.... despite that you have a great shot here..... I gave you a 9 initially but I think it is really worthy of a 10. good luck, Todd. 10.</td>', 'Best shot of the challenge in my opinion. Would like to have seen the sun lower in the sky perhaps, and may more hidden behind the clouds. The size and overexposed-ness of the sun is juuuuust a little distracting in my opinion.... despite that you have a great shot here..... I gave you a 9 initially but I think it is really worthy of a 10. good luck, Todd. 10.', '2004-04-21 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
