(680017, 70642, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional B&amp;W image. Nice greyscales, lighting and composition. There is a touch of haloing along the sharp edges of the boats but no other digital artifacts. The fog and calmness of the water gives this a haunting richness deserving of a ribbon in this challenge.</td>', 'Exceptional B&W image. Nice greyscales, lighting and composition. There is a touch of haloing along the sharp edges of the boats but no other digital artifacts. The fog and calmness of the water gives this a haunting richness deserving of a ribbon in this challenge.', '2004-04-21 18:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(680025, 70302, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great capture and framing and shallow DOF adds much to this composition. Your choice to highlight yellow coloring helps make this an outstanding image and one of the best of this challenge.</td>', 'Great capture and framing and shallow DOF adds much to this composition. Your choice to highlight yellow coloring helps make this an outstanding image and one of the best of this challenge.', '2004-04-21 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(680062, 70887, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours in sky. Not sure about the placement of the sun in the shot, I''d prefer it on one of the thirds junctions. I''d like to see a sharper foreground. Dramatic mood though.</td>', 'Interesting colours in sky. Not sure about the placement of the sun in the shot, I''d prefer it on one of the thirds junctions. I''d like to see a sharper foreground. Dramatic mood though.', '2004-04-21 18:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(680065, 70600, 17536, '<td valign="top">Nice industrial picture. A cloudy sky would add interest, but I like the starkness of this image as well.</td>', 'Nice industrial picture. A cloudy sky would add interest, but I like the starkness of this image as well.', '2004-04-21 18:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(680069, 70702, 17536, '<td valign="top">Love the clouds. It''s a nice calming image.</td>', 'Love the clouds. It''s a nice calming image.', '2004-04-21 18:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(680071, 70649, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to backlight this statue. However, I see a lot of monuments with riders on horses in most towns and cities I go to, so this doesn''t have as much impact as it should. I wish there were no trees in the background, or trees with a more striking outline. I think the shadow detail works well here. Edit: I see no reason why this shouldn''t be a helpful comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-30 09:27:13.</i></td>', 'Nice idea to backlight this statue. However, I see a lot of monuments with riders on horses in most towns and cities I go to, so this doesn''t have as much impact as it should. I wish there were no trees in the background, or trees with a more striking outline. I think the shadow detail works well here. Edit: I see no reason why this shouldn''t be a helpful comment.', '2004-04-21 18:56:17.000000', '2004-04-30 10:27:13.000000', 1),
(680072, 70768, 17536, '<td valign="top">More sky than silhouette, but a beauty of a picture nonetheless.</td>', 'More sky than silhouette, but a beauty of a picture nonetheless.', '2004-04-21 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(680076, 70911, 17536, '<td valign="top">I was going to do this type of shot. Nice execution and great but subtle colors.</td>', 'I was going to do this type of shot. Nice execution and great but subtle colors.', '2004-04-21 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(680078, 70715, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, but I wish the sky was more interesting or dramatic. I''d have been tempted to increase reds using the Colour Balance tool in Photoshop, perhaps in the highlights and increased blues in the shadows. I also wish the trees were much sharper. I love the shape of the hills.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, but I wish the sky was more interesting or dramatic. I''d have been tempted to increase reds using the Colour Balance tool in Photoshop, perhaps in the highlights and increased blues in the shadows. I also wish the trees were much sharper. I love the shape of the hills.', '2004-04-21 18:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(680079, 70783, 17536, '<td valign="top">Nice duck, but not a silhouette. More of a profile. Cool image though.</td>', 'Nice duck, but not a silhouette. More of a profile. Cool image though.', '2004-04-21 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(680080, 70610, 17536, '<td valign="top">That bird looks lonely.</td>', 'That bird looks lonely.', '2004-04-21 18:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(680081, 70669, 17536, '<td valign="top">nice image. love the clouds. did you wait for the bird or was that a luck break?</td>', 'nice image. love the clouds. did you wait for the bird or was that a luck break?', '2004-04-21 19:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(680082, 70929, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting sky and tree, but the composition doesn''t work for me. There is not enough ground for my taste, and there''s not enough negative space to the right of the tree. You really should have cloned out the power lines, they really spoil the shot. I love the colours in the sky on the horizon.</td>', 'Interesting sky and tree, but the composition doesn''t work for me. There is not enough ground for my taste, and there''s not enough negative space to the right of the tree. You really should have cloned out the power lines, they really spoil the shot. I love the colours in the sky on the horizon.', '2004-04-21 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(680085, 70955, 17536, '<td valign="top">Nice sky/subject contrast. I wish the angle was less steep so you could make out the statue a bit better.</td>', 'Nice sky/subject contrast. I wish the angle was less steep so you could make out the statue a bit better.', '2004-04-21 19:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(680089, 70959, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind seeing some shadow detail in a silhouette shot, but this is stretching the challenge too much IMO.</td>', 'I don''t mind seeing some shadow detail in a silhouette shot, but this is stretching the challenge too much IMO.', '2004-04-21 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(680091, 70566, 19311, '<td valign="top">Amazing idea and extremely well executed.  If I could vote, this would get a 10</td>', 'Amazing idea and extremely well executed.  If I could vote, this would get a 10', '2004-04-21 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(680094, 70902, 8522, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking. Shame the sky is a little noisy, and that the silhouette isn''t less cluttered in places. I wish it was sharper. Wonderful mood and composition though. 9</td>', 'Breathtaking. Shame the sky is a little noisy, and that the silhouette isn''t less cluttered in places. I wish it was sharper. Wonderful mood and composition though. 9', '2004-04-21 19:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(680102, 70771, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and stark silhouette. There is digital haloing along the outline of the cathedral but not too bad. A little noise reduction would make the clouds look smoother and add more to this fine image.</td>', 'Interesting composition and stark silhouette. There is digital haloing along the outline of the cathedral but not too bad. A little noise reduction would make the clouds look smoother and add more to this fine image.', '2004-04-21 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(680104, 70698, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good action silhouette. The grainy and white outline to the skate boarder seems to fit well. I''m interested to learn the technique used to achieve the outline effect.</td>', 'Good action silhouette. The grainy and white outline to the skate boarder seems to fit well. I''m interested to learn the technique used to achieve the outline effect.', '2004-04-21 19:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(680167, 70662, 8522, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a silhouette, but I''m not sure what you wanted to achieve with it. It just seems a bit boring to me, especially with it''s centred composition. I think the trees were a nice idea, but there is too much clutter in the background. Good exposure, just the right amount of shadow detail.</td>', 'This is indeed a silhouette, but I''m not sure what you wanted to achieve with it. It just seems a bit boring to me, especially with it''s centred composition. I think the trees were a nice idea, but there is too much clutter in the background. Good exposure, just the right amount of shadow detail.', '2004-04-21 19:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(680175, 70341, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, great colours in the sky. I''d have used the colour balance in Photoshop to change the shadow colours slightly, which seem a bit dull and grey. A tighter crop would have added more power to the shot. There are large pixelated clumps in the sky... is this as a result of using NeatImage? Or maybe saving as too low a quality jpeg. I wish the boat was much sharper. Great silhouette though.</td>', 'Lovely shot, great colours in the sky. I''d have used the colour balance in Photoshop to change the shadow colours slightly, which seem a bit dull and grey. A tighter crop would have added more power to the shot. There are large pixelated clumps in the sky... is this as a result of using NeatImage? Or maybe saving as too low a quality jpeg. I wish the boat was much sharper. Great silhouette though.', '2004-04-21 20:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(680272, 70503, 18098, '<td valign="top">This picture is wonderful!</td>', 'This picture is wonderful!', '2004-04-21 20:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(680277, 70570, 18098, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture.', '2004-04-21 20:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(680281, 70701, 18098, '<td valign="top">I rated this picture low because it was dark. 3</td>', 'I rated this picture low because it was dark. 3', '2004-04-21 20:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(680362, 70959, 2158, '<td valign="top">From the challenge description: "Silhouettes are created by backlit subjects, which causes them to appear solid and without much detail."<br/>This is a nice shot, but I can''t see how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'From the challenge description: "Silhouettes are created by backlit subjects, which causes them to appear solid and without much detail."This is a nice shot, but I can''t see how it fits the challenge.', '2004-04-21 21:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(680372, 70899, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  I love the way the stances are the same!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  I love the way the stances are the same!', '2004-04-21 22:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(680377, 70783, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but it''s not a silhouette.</td>', 'Great shot, but it''s not a silhouette.', '2004-04-21 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(680405, 70411, 16151, '<td valign="top">I love the subject of the photo along with the color (or lack thereof). <br/> <br/>Good Job.</td>', 'I love the subject of the photo along with the color (or lack thereof).  Good Job.', '2004-04-21 22:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(680413, 70745, 16151, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  Good job.</td>', 'I love this shot!  Good job.', '2004-04-21 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(680420, 70768, 16151, '<td valign="top">Pretty good overall photo.  The positioning of the boat and the sun make this shot. <br/> <br/>The only thing that I would have maybe done (or tried to do) is get the boat where the top of it does not bleed into the shoreline - tried to get water between the top of the boat and the shoreline.</td>', 'Pretty good overall photo.  The positioning of the boat and the sun make this shot.  The only thing that I would have maybe done (or tried to do) is get the boat where the top of it does not bleed into the shoreline - tried to get water between the top of the boat and the shoreline.', '2004-04-21 22:15:54.000000', NULL, 1);
