(680508, 70746, 14386, '<td valign="top">It''s very good. You have been very generous with your use of "curves". Effect is nice but it looks a bit unreal. I like the composition very much. 7</td>', 'It''s very good. You have been very generous with your use of "curves". Effect is nice but it looks a bit unreal. I like the composition very much. 7', '2004-04-21 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(680515, 70771, 14386, '<td valign="top">Cool. It looks too heavy though. maybe a sepia would do.</td>', 'Cool. It looks too heavy though. maybe a sepia would do.', '2004-04-21 22:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(680523, 70684, 3306, '<td valign="top">Magnificent sky.</td>', 'Magnificent sky.', '2004-04-21 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(680526, 70566, 3306, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Very creative. Well done.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Very creative. Well done.', '2004-04-21 22:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(680528, 70503, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and unique. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful and unique. One of my favorites.', '2004-04-21 22:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(680529, 70734, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very good. One of my favorites. The 2 dots in the lower left are a little distracting.</td>', 'Very good. One of my favorites. The 2 dots in the lower left are a little distracting.', '2004-04-21 23:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(680530, 70935, 3306, '<td valign="top">Lovely, soft texture.</td>', 'Lovely, soft texture.', '2004-04-21 23:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(680532, 70698, 20324, '<td valign="top">I love it, the glow is very effective. I would crop it a little bit differently. I wouldn''t be suprised if some people might think it''s a graphic art (aka a drawing or cutt out) and not a photo. (9)</td>', 'I love it, the glow is very effective. I would crop it a little bit differently. I wouldn''t be suprised if some people might think it''s a graphic art (aka a drawing or cutt out) and not a photo. (9)', '2004-04-21 23:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(680533, 70948, 20324, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. I like the warm colors and the texture.  (Are they fibres in a piece of paper?) Nice composition. (9)</td>', 'Cool effect. I like the warm colors and the texture.  (Are they fibres in a piece of paper?) Nice composition. (9)', '2004-04-21 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(680536, 70801, 20324, '<td valign="top">Almost surreal. Looks great and artistic.  Composition is fantastic. The color near the base of the trees draws the viewers attention. (10)</td>', 'Almost surreal. Looks great and artistic.  Composition is fantastic. The color near the base of the trees draws the viewers attention. (10)', '2004-04-21 23:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(680537, 70503, 20324, '<td valign="top">I like the warm colors and the rippled reflection of the silhouettes. (8)</td>', 'I like the warm colors and the rippled reflection of the silhouettes. (8)', '2004-04-21 23:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(680540, 70933, 20324, '<td valign="top">Nice warm effect. The silhouette of the person doesn''t fit this composition.</td>', 'Nice warm effect. The silhouette of the person doesn''t fit this composition.', '2004-04-21 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680543, 70781, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very cute,I love it ! 10</td>', 'Very cute,I love it ! 10', '2004-04-21 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(680546, 70662, 12268, '<td valign="top">the fading colurs of the sky is really nice. This might have worked better if the tree was in the FG &amp; the lamp in the BG bc the lamp is not in silhoette.</td>', 'the fading colurs of the sky is really nice. This might have worked better if the tree was in the FG & the lamp in the BG bc the lamp is not in silhoette.', '2004-04-21 23:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(680547, 70522, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice sky,more simple subject instead of 4 would work better,7 !</td>', 'Nice sky,more simple subject instead of 4 would work better,7 !', '2004-04-21 23:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(680548, 70302, 12268, '<td valign="top">very nice stop action shot. Love the golden colour of the water.</td>', 'very nice stop action shot. Love the golden colour of the water.', '2004-04-21 23:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(680549, 70918, 6405, '<td valign="top">I like girls with glasses,9 !</td>', 'I like girls with glasses,9 !', '2004-04-21 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(680551, 70201, 12268, '<td valign="top">very nice. I really like the soft focus here, adds a bit of fairy tale-esque type feeling. Lovely reflected colours off the water, good composition &amp; use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'very nice. I really like the soft focus here, adds a bit of fairy tale-esque type feeling. Lovely reflected colours off the water, good composition & use of the rule of thirds.', '2004-04-21 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(680552, 70708, 6405, '<td valign="top">Super done,10 !</td>', 'Super done,10 !', '2004-04-21 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(680554, 70719, 6405, '<td valign="top">Interesting frame,180 degree rotation might work better,8 !</td>', 'Interesting frame,180 degree rotation might work better,8 !', '2004-04-21 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(680555, 70546, 12268, '<td valign="top">i wish the subject was off centre a bit. other than that,. nice shot</td>', 'i wish the subject was off centre a bit. other than that,. nice shot', '2004-04-21 23:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(680557, 70732, 12268, '<td valign="top">whoa, creepy! nice capture!</td>', 'whoa, creepy! nice capture!', '2004-04-21 23:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(680558, 70496, 12268, '<td valign="top">very cute. love the sky colours, adds a lot to the shot!</td>', 'very cute. love the sky colours, adds a lot to the shot!', '2004-04-21 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(680559, 70341, 6405, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the pirate ship in Madeira Beach Florida,9 !</td>', 'Reminds me of the pirate ship in Madeira Beach Florida,9 !', '2004-04-21 23:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(680562, 70783, 12268, '<td valign="top">was this a mistake submission for this challenge? I hate to do it but I''m gonna have to give this a 1. Sorry but where''s the silhoette?</td>', 'was this a mistake submission for this challenge? I hate to do it but I''m gonna have to give this a 1. Sorry but where''s the silhoette?', '2004-04-21 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(680563, 70566, 12268, '<td valign="top">Man, I wish I had thought of this first. Great shot Love it. Would even say it is a ribbon winner! Good luck! oh yeah, 10!</td>', 'Man, I wish I had thought of this first. Great shot Love it. Would even say it is a ribbon winner! Good luck! oh yeah, 10!', '2004-04-21 23:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(680571, 70302, 18552, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous silhouette.</td>', 'Gorgeous silhouette.', '2004-04-21 23:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(680572, 70317, 15768, '<td valign="top">Great Picture! Are those shadows of your fingers?</td>', 'Great Picture! Are those shadows of your fingers?', '2004-04-21 23:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(680573, 70370, 12268, '<td valign="top">groovy indeed! I love it! Another one I wish I had thought of first! Curses!<br/>Groovilicious 10 from me! Good luck in the ribbon run as I imagine you are right up there!</td>', 'groovy indeed! I love it! Another one I wish I had thought of first! Curses!Groovilicious 10 from me! Good luck in the ribbon run as I imagine you are right up there!', '2004-04-21 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(680576, 70906, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette.</td>', 'Very nice silhouette.', '2004-04-21 23:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(680577, 70523, 12268, '<td valign="top">simply fantastic! great composition &amp; use of the rule of thirds. Love the BG &amp; the top of the mosque. Really great! 10!</td>', 'simply fantastic! great composition & use of the rule of thirds. Love the BG & the top of the mosque. Really great! 10!', '2004-04-21 23:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(680579, 70320, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting silhouette. It is slightly blurry but perhaps you did that on purpose.</td>', 'Very interesting silhouette. It is slightly blurry but perhaps you did that on purpose.', '2004-04-21 23:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(680583, 70951, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture for his challenge. I supposed because you can see some of the details of the angel it isn''t technically a silhouette but I really like it.</td>', 'Very interesting picture for his challenge. I supposed because you can see some of the details of the angel it isn''t technically a silhouette but I really like it.', '2004-04-21 23:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(680584, 70639, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Very creative idea for this challenge.', '2004-04-21 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(680585, 70649, 15768, '<td valign="top">Amazing dynamic image!</td>', 'Amazing dynamic image!', '2004-04-21 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(680586, 70642, 6405, '<td valign="top">Classic,10 !</td>', 'Classic,10 !', '2004-04-21 23:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680588, 70840, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I think it might have been just as effective if the two people had been a bit closer together.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I think it might have been just as effective if the two people had been a bit closer together.', '2004-04-21 23:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(680590, 70792, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette. It looks a bit over-contrasty.</td>', 'Very nice silhouette. It looks a bit over-contrasty.', '2004-04-21 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(680592, 70896, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very well done picture. I really like how this silhouette is crisply defined against the sky.</td>', 'Very well done picture. I really like how this silhouette is crisply defined against the sky.', '2004-04-21 23:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(680597, 70732, 18552, '<td valign="top">What an interesting picture. I know there must be a thread of spider''s web in there somewhere but I can''t see it. Great Job.</td>', 'What an interesting picture. I know there must be a thread of spider''s web in there somewhere but I can''t see it. Great Job.', '2004-04-21 23:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(680598, 70201, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely, moody silhouette. I like the look of it very much - like a watercolor painting.</td>', 'Lovely, moody silhouette. I like the look of it very much - like a watercolor painting.', '2004-04-21 23:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(680600, 70610, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nice bird silhouette. I think the bottom two wires could have been cropped off and the picture would have been more effective. The color scheme is nice.</td>', 'Nice bird silhouette. I think the bottom two wires could have been cropped off and the picture would have been more effective. The color scheme is nice.', '2004-04-21 23:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(680626, 70935, 7485, '<td valign="top">Classic subject for a silhouette, very well done. I''d prefer the shadows to be deeper though, there are still some gradients on her face, arm, and breast. Also I''d remove the slight halo on her left side (sharpening artifact?). But the pose is great and the highlights on her back are beautiful. 8</td>', 'Classic subject for a silhouette, very well done. I''d prefer the shadows to be deeper though, there are still some gradients on her face, arm, and breast. Also I''d remove the slight halo on her left side (sharpening artifact?). But the pose is great and the highlights on her back are beautiful. 8', '2004-04-22 00:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(680631, 70959, 7485, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the distracting background, the foreground is great!</td>', 'Too bad about the distracting background, the foreground is great!', '2004-04-22 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(680638, 70511, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great scene, but the compression artifacts mar the results. Your file is just 44KB, it could have been three times bigger (and consequently artifact-free) and still fit the rules.</td>', 'Great scene, but the compression artifacts mar the results. Your file is just 44KB, it could have been three times bigger (and consequently artifact-free) and still fit the rules.', '2004-04-22 00:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(680644, 70918, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I especially like the glasses catching the light. Only thing I''d prefer different is to have the walls in the foreground truly black. 9</td>', 'Beautifully done. I especially like the glasses catching the light. Only thing I''d prefer different is to have the walls in the foreground truly black. 9', '2004-04-22 00:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(680660, 70698, 9906, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed to the point that it''s not a photo any more...<br/>TC</td>', 'Overprocessed to the point that it''s not a photo any more...TC', '2004-04-22 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(680661, 70803, 7485, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped the distracting wall on the far left, otherwise excellent</td>', 'I''d have cropped the distracting wall on the far left, otherwise excellent', '2004-04-22 00:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(680710, 70840, 8367, '<td valign="top">A classic example of silhouettes. Great photo!</td>', 'A classic example of silhouettes. Great photo!', '2004-04-22 01:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(680715, 70637, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, and I''m sure you''ve been told this already, but I think this could be more of a silhouette. Nice shadow, but seems a little unrealistic.</td>', 'Cool shot, and I''m sure you''ve been told this already, but I think this could be more of a silhouette. Nice shadow, but seems a little unrealistic.', '2004-04-22 01:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(680721, 70929, 9668, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the power lines. Nicely outlined tree, although I can''t say it is original.</td>', 'Too bad about the power lines. Nicely outlined tree, although I can''t say it is original.', '2004-04-22 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(680726, 70803, 9668, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I''m not really seeing the three silhouettes. It is a nicely composed picture though.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I''m not really seeing the three silhouettes. It is a nicely composed picture though.', '2004-04-22 02:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(680731, 70938, 9668, '<td valign="top">#1 kind of unoriginal (how were you supposed to know) of trees at sunset<br/>#2 I would like to see three trees instead of 4 (triangulation: the eye is drawn to threes)<br/>Good shot overall though, I like the mountain range in the bg(background).</td>', '#1 kind of unoriginal (how were you supposed to know) of trees at sunset#2 I would like to see three trees instead of 4 (triangulation: the eye is drawn to threes)Good shot overall though, I like the mountain range in the bg(background).', '2004-04-22 02:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(680734, 70937, 9668, '<td valign="top">Original! I think the sky could have a little more contrast but I love the light off the water and the composition. Hard to catch a lone duck on the beach at sunset in one week. good work. 9</td>', 'Original! I think the sky could have a little more contrast but I love the light off the water and the composition. Hard to catch a lone duck on the beach at sunset in one week. good work. 9', '2004-04-22 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
