(680768, 70370, 7151, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you might take a hit from the digital manipulations in the windows challenge this week.  This has a bit of a "digitally created" feel.  Disgarding that, its an OK shot, the colors are nice, but the attention is really drawn by the background, and the sillouette is kind of more of a distraction.  But not a bad effort or idea.</td>', 'I''m guessing you might take a hit from the digital manipulations in the windows challenge this week.  This has a bit of a "digitally created" feel.  Disgarding that, its an OK shot, the colors are nice, but the attention is really drawn by the background, and the sillouette is kind of more of a distraction.  But not a bad effort or idea.', '2004-04-22 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(680786, 70834, 7151, '<td valign="top">Whatever it is you did to blacken the subjects, I don''t like it.  Looks like a kid got to it with scissors.</td>', 'Whatever it is you did to blacken the subjects, I don''t like it.  Looks like a kid got to it with scissors.', '2004-04-22 02:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(680792, 70568, 7151, '<td valign="top">Weird treatment for a bride.  Between the darkness and the "attitude" (as if she''s lunging at you), it makes her look somehow imposing or evil.  Maybe you have commitment issues..?  (just kidding)  :)</td>', 'Weird treatment for a bride.  Between the darkness and the "attitude" (as if she''s lunging at you), it makes her look somehow imposing or evil.  Maybe you have commitment issues..?  (just kidding)  :)', '2004-04-22 02:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
