(680831, 70610, 18722, '<td valign="top">The lower lines pull my attention from the subject; croping just above them allows my attention to remain focussed.  I like the tones a lot.</td>', 'The lower lines pull my attention from the subject; croping just above them allows my attention to remain focussed.  I like the tones a lot.', '2004-04-22 03:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
