(680834, 70819, 18722, '<td valign="top">The loss of contrast at the wrist and arm kills it for me, I''m afraid.  A very good idea and I love the coloring, but I think it would have been better if held at a point just out of the frame.</td>', 'The loss of contrast at the wrist and arm kills it for me, I''m afraid.  A very good idea and I love the coloring, but I think it would have been better if held at a point just out of the frame.', '2004-04-22 03:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
