(680866, 70568, 18722, '<td valign="top">At first I thought, ''it does not work with (mainly) just the face silhouetted''.  But then I remembered the bride is not to be seen before the wedding -- and it works.</td>', 'At first I thought, ''it does not work with (mainly) just the face silhouetted''.  But then I remembered the bride is not to be seen before the wedding -- and it works.', '2004-04-22 04:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(680868, 70758, 18722, '<td valign="top">The sky looks very much over-done.</td>', 'The sky looks very much over-done.', '2004-04-22 04:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680870, 70206, 18722, '<td valign="top">I find the black area at the bottom to be too large.  I would have preferred a tighter crop on the bottom.</td>', 'I find the black area at the bottom to be too large.  I would have preferred a tighter crop on the bottom.', '2004-04-22 04:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(680873, 70129, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice dual-tone.  A pleasant change from the typical skyline photos.</td>', 'Very nice dual-tone.  A pleasant change from the typical skyline photos.', '2004-04-22 04:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680884, 70912, 18722, '<td valign="top">Having two independant subjects splits my attention.  I like the top one best, and think it makes a more dramatic statement if cropped just below the light aura.</td>', 'Having two independant subjects splits my attention.  I like the top one best, and think it makes a more dramatic statement if cropped just below the light aura.', '2004-04-22 04:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(680887, 69936, 18722, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the reflected light source, but I think it would have worked better if not centered.</td>', 'I like the colors and the reflected light source, but I think it would have worked better if not centered.', '2004-04-22 04:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(680888, 70503, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-04-22 04:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(680889, 70626, 18722, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the left and bottom would create a much more stunning image, in my opinion.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the left and bottom would create a much more stunning image, in my opinion.', '2004-04-22 04:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(680891, 70268, 18722, '<td valign="top">The two subject flow together.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'The two subject flow together.  Nicely composed.', '2004-04-22 04:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(680893, 70684, 18722, '<td valign="top">Proof positive someone can put anything in front of a sky like that, and get a great image.</td>', 'Proof positive someone can put anything in front of a sky like that, and get a great image.', '2004-04-22 04:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(680894, 70887, 18722, '<td valign="top">Looks like your trees are on fire.</td>', 'Looks like your trees are on fire.', '2004-04-22 04:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(680899, 69737, 18722, '<td valign="top">Looks almost lost in time.  Very nice, but the white sky is almost overpowering.</td>', 'Looks almost lost in time.  Very nice, but the white sky is almost overpowering.', '2004-04-22 05:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(680901, 70797, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The number of limbs give it a very busy look that I am not sure I like, but it does not detract from the image.</td>', 'Nice.  The number of limbs give it a very busy look that I am not sure I like, but it does not detract from the image.', '2004-04-22 05:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(680905, 70341, 18722, '<td valign="top">The softness of the ship makes it seem mirage-like.</td>', 'The softness of the ship makes it seem mirage-like.', '2004-04-22 05:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(680924, 70712, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I think some people may criticise this photo in a silhouette challenge, as one point of focus might be the face, which is not silhouetted here. The arm is beautifully silhouetted, and there is just the right amount of shadow detail across the whole shot. Good lighting. Great skin tones. Very atmospheric shot. Good composition and use of negative space.</td>', 'Beautiful... I think some people may criticise this photo in a silhouette challenge, as one point of focus might be the face, which is not silhouetted here. The arm is beautifully silhouetted, and there is just the right amount of shadow detail across the whole shot. Good lighting. Great skin tones. Very atmospheric shot. Good composition and use of negative space.', '2004-04-22 06:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(680925, 70953, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, possibly a little too arty for the DPC crowd. It''s hard to tell whether the blown highlights are accidental, or part of the photographer''s style here. The crop is unusual, again it''s difficult to know if the tip of the shoe on the left has been deliberately cropped or not.The composition is certainly unusual, the shoes cut the frame in two (top and bottom) which doesn''t normally work well. I think it works well here however. I think that this shot can only really work as part of a series with other similar shots, but here I will give it an above average score.</td>', 'Interesting shot, possibly a little too arty for the DPC crowd. It''s hard to tell whether the blown highlights are accidental, or part of the photographer''s style here. The crop is unusual, again it''s difficult to know if the tip of the shoe on the left has been deliberately cropped or not.The composition is certainly unusual, the shoes cut the frame in two (top and bottom) which doesn''t normally work well. I think it works well here however. I think that this shot can only really work as part of a series with other similar shots, but here I will give it an above average score.', '2004-04-22 06:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(680931, 70768, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting sunset, but I think you were wrong to break the rule of thirds here. Was there a reason why you put the horizon and water so low down in the frame? And the sun is too near the edge of the frame. Therefore, any points of focus are difficult to settle on as they are too near the edge of the frame. In Photoshop I think you could have played with levels and curves to make the boat stand out more from the water. The boat doesn''t look too sharp, and it looks like your lens needed a clean judging by some marks in the water to the left of the boat. There are some nice colours in the sky, which might possibly have been enhanced by using Colour Balance in Photoshop.</td>', 'Interesting sunset, but I think you were wrong to break the rule of thirds here. Was there a reason why you put the horizon and water so low down in the frame? And the sun is too near the edge of the frame. Therefore, any points of focus are difficult to settle on as they are too near the edge of the frame. In Photoshop I think you could have played with levels and curves to make the boat stand out more from the water. The boat doesn''t look too sharp, and it looks like your lens needed a clean judging by some marks in the water to the left of the boat. There are some nice colours in the sky, which might possibly have been enhanced by using Colour Balance in Photoshop.', '2004-04-22 06:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(680951, 70201, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  The small vertical crop is bound to be held against you, but it works and I can not see that it would with a larger crop.  The colors are great.</td>', 'Very, very nice.  The small vertical crop is bound to be held against you, but it works and I can not see that it would with a larger crop.  The colors are great.', '2004-04-22 06:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(680952, 70902, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The contrast between the black forground and the red sky is very striking.</td>', 'Very nice.  The contrast between the black forground and the red sky is very striking.', '2004-04-22 06:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(680955, 70749, 18722, '<td valign="top">First, I like this picture.  Second .. hmm, ok, I really like this picture.  I sure wish I knew why - I feel like I am missing something by not knowing.  Very inventive aproach to the challenge.</td>', 'First, I like this picture.  Second .. hmm, ok, I really like this picture.  I sure wish I knew why - I feel like I am missing something by not knowing.  Very inventive aproach to the challenge.', '2004-04-22 06:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(680981, 70802, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, the slanted horizon works well. I''m not sure it was a good idea to crop the model''s head. There''s a little too much magenta for my taste, which looks like it was added in post-processing. Nice shadow detail in the foreground, and good idea for a silhouette.</td>', 'Interesting shot, the slanted horizon works well. I''m not sure it was a good idea to crop the model''s head. There''s a little too much magenta for my taste, which looks like it was added in post-processing. Nice shadow detail in the foreground, and good idea for a silhouette.', '2004-04-22 08:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(680982, 70828, 8522, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught a lovely moment in the sky with it''s corresponding light on the water, it''s almost a shame there''s your main subject in the way. I can''t help feeling though that the use of light in the background is the most interesting thing in this shot and should have been exploited more. Again, there are some beautiful silhouetted hills in the background I would like to see more of. The structure in the foreground really doesn''t interest me that much and it''s composition here is unimaginative. It is silhouetted, but there''s too much interesting clutter behind it for the silhouette to really pop out. There''s a lovely mood to this shot though.</td>', 'You''ve caught a lovely moment in the sky with it''s corresponding light on the water, it''s almost a shame there''s your main subject in the way. I can''t help feeling though that the use of light in the background is the most interesting thing in this shot and should have been exploited more. Again, there are some beautiful silhouetted hills in the background I would like to see more of. The structure in the foreground really doesn''t interest me that much and it''s composition here is unimaginative. It is silhouetted, but there''s too much interesting clutter behind it for the silhouette to really pop out. There''s a lovely mood to this shot though.', '2004-04-22 08:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(680983, 70899, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, fantastic shot. I love this kind of composition where a subject is ''imitating'' something in the background and it is carried off superbly here. The exposure is spot on. I even like your title, although I normally hate puns. 10/10... superb. If I saw this as a postcard, I''d buy it!</td>', 'Oh wow, fantastic shot. I love this kind of composition where a subject is ''imitating'' something in the background and it is carried off superbly here. The exposure is spot on. I even like your title, although I normally hate puns. 10/10... superb. If I saw this as a postcard, I''d buy it!', '2004-04-22 08:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(680985, 70626, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Fits the challenge well. Great sky. Well composed, even though I normally don''t like the horizon in the middle of a shot. My only criticism is that the colours seem a little dull and look like they need enhancing in Photoshop a little.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Fits the challenge well. Great sky. Well composed, even though I normally don''t like the horizon in the middle of a shot. My only criticism is that the colours seem a little dull and look like they need enhancing in Photoshop a little.', '2004-04-22 08:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(680987, 70801, 8522, '<td valign="top">High-impact shot, but too obviously manipulated in Photoshop for my taste. The dodging/burning on the brown near the trees has worked well, but it''s the blue haze around the trees that doesn''t work for me. Nice composition.</td>', 'High-impact shot, but too obviously manipulated in Photoshop for my taste. The dodging/burning on the brown near the trees has worked well, but it''s the blue haze around the trees that doesn''t work for me. Nice composition.', '2004-04-22 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(681037, 70669, 19678, '<td valign="top">Nice job of capturing the bird above.</td>', 'Nice job of capturing the bird above.', '2004-04-22 10:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(681122, 70771, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.10</td>', 'Fantastic.10', '2004-04-22 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(681123, 70858, 6130, '<td valign="top">So beautiful.</td>', 'So beautiful.', '2004-04-22 11:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(681152, 70420, 3569, '<td valign="top">Flamingo!</td>', 'Flamingo!', '2004-04-22 12:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(681175, 70951, 9668, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like the sun star. VERY minor thing: there is a little black edge in the lower left corner, won''t effect anything. I like the concept of this</td>', 'Good shot. I like the sun star. VERY minor thing: there is a little black edge in the lower left corner, won''t effect anything. I like the concept of this', '2004-04-22 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(681179, 70912, 9668, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, I wonder how long/hard it was for you to get this. Great backlighting. The only I would like to see is more of the bottom and a little less of the top. Excellent job.</td>', 'Amazing shot, I wonder how long/hard it was for you to get this. Great backlighting. The only I would like to see is more of the bottom and a little less of the top. Excellent job.', '2004-04-22 12:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(681191, 70699, 9668, '<td valign="top">At first the noise in this photo distracted me. But I think it is actually a nice addition, it gives it kind of an older feel. Love the clouds.</td>', 'At first the noise in this photo distracted me. But I think it is actually a nice addition, it gives it kind of an older feel. Love the clouds.', '2004-04-22 12:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(681199, 70773, 17166, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think your choice to throw out the rule of thirds and putting the horizon right in the middle helps give this picture a great sense of balance.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think your choice to throw out the rule of thirds and putting the horizon right in the middle helps give this picture a great sense of balance.', '2004-04-22 12:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(681240, 70935, 3697, '<td valign="top">Now this is a silhouette I could definately get used to seeing :) Nice composition and I like the lighting, good shot.</td>', 'Now this is a silhouette I could definately get used to seeing :) Nice composition and I like the lighting, good shot.', '2004-04-22 12:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
