(681606, 70858, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the monochromatic feel to this adds greatly to the image. Between the clouds and her hair flowing I feel like I can almost hear the wind. Originally gave you an 8 but I think it''s worth a 10. I wish I had taken it. Good Luck, Todd. 10.</td>', 'Great shot, the monochromatic feel to this adds greatly to the image. Between the clouds and her hair flowing I feel like I can almost hear the wind. Originally gave you an 8 but I think it''s worth a 10. I wish I had taken it. Good Luck, Todd. 10.', '2004-04-22 17:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(681608, 70914, 7758, '<td valign="top">Good use of the shilouette and nice backdrop too. Just feel the blacks could be blacker. Good Luck, Todd. 7.</td>', 'Good use of the shilouette and nice backdrop too. Just feel the blacks could be blacker. Good Luck, Todd. 7.', '2004-04-22 18:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(681611, 70566, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of the hand of god. Simple but strong composition. I think it would have been more powerful taken later in the day, or with more billowing like clouds in the background, but these things are not always within our control. Good Luck, Todd. 7.</td>', 'Nice depiction of the hand of god. Simple but strong composition. I think it would have been more powerful taken later in the day, or with more billowing like clouds in the background, but these things are not always within our control. Good Luck, Todd. 7.', '2004-04-22 18:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(681612, 70911, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I moght have been tempted to crank up the saturation a little though. Good Luck, Todd. 7.</td>', 'Nice composition, I moght have been tempted to crank up the saturation a little though. Good Luck, Todd. 7.', '2004-04-22 18:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(681623, 70829, 7758, '<td valign="top">I like the setting for this shot and I think you almost pulled it off. A single figure walking towards the light would have made this so much stronger for me. As it is I think it the people in the background are very distracting and take away alot from the image. If I were you I''d reshoot it with a single person in it, I think it would be a really strong image. Good Luck, Todd. 6.</td>', 'I like the setting for this shot and I think you almost pulled it off. A single figure walking towards the light would have made this so much stronger for me. As it is I think it the people in the background are very distracting and take away alot from the image. If I were you I''d reshoot it with a single person in it, I think it would be a really strong image. Good Luck, Todd. 6.', '2004-04-22 18:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(681633, 69936, 7758, '<td valign="top">I think you were on the right track here. If I can offer a little advice, I would have shot this from a little lower and had the reflected sun directly behind the subjects. Also I would have had the two children stand seperate and holding hands instead. The reason I say this is that it almost looks like it is one child with 4 legs (not really, but you know what I''m getting at).... and perhaps shot it a little tighter, lifted the contrast a little more to make it more of a shilouette and a little more saturation. I hope this helps. Good Luck, Todd. 6.</td>', 'I think you were on the right track here. If I can offer a little advice, I would have shot this from a little lower and had the reflected sun directly behind the subjects. Also I would have had the two children stand seperate and holding hands instead. The reason I say this is that it almost looks like it is one child with 4 legs (not really, but you know what I''m getting at).... and perhaps shot it a little tighter, lifted the contrast a little more to make it more of a shilouette and a little more saturation. I hope this helps. Good Luck, Todd. 6.', '2004-04-22 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(681636, 70885, 7758, '<td valign="top">this seems to be rather grainy looking in the shadowed areas, perhaps a little more contrast mught have helped. Good Luck, Todd. 5.</td>', 'this seems to be rather grainy looking in the shadowed areas, perhaps a little more contrast mught have helped. Good Luck, Todd. 5.', '2004-04-22 18:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(681645, 70568, 7758, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this really works as an image, it is somewhat shilouetted but I think the fact that you cannot see the girls face really hurts this shot. Perhaps it would have been better to show her profile so we at least get some idea of what she looks like. As it stands I look at it and think ''yeah it''s a shilouette, but why?''. It looks more like an accidental shot where the flash failed to fire.  I hope you don''t think that I''m being too harsh. Good Luck, Todd. 4.</td>', 'I''m not sure this really works as an image, it is somewhat shilouetted but I think the fact that you cannot see the girls face really hurts this shot. Perhaps it would have been better to show her profile so we at least get some idea of what she looks like. As it stands I look at it and think ''yeah it''s a shilouette, but why?''. It looks more like an accidental shot where the flash failed to fire.  I hope you don''t think that I''m being too harsh. Good Luck, Todd. 4.', '2004-04-22 18:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(681655, 70806, 7758, '<td valign="top">Focus is an issue here. I think that sort of stablisation might have helped. Overall I don''t think this is a very appealing image. I am assuming that these are bar taps, perhaps it sould have been a stronger image to just show on tap and even a shilouetted profile of the barman pouring a beer. I hope you don''t think that I''m being too harsh but I have only given you a two for this image, it  really doesn''t hold much interest or appeal for me. Good Luck, Todd. 2.</td>', 'Focus is an issue here. I think that sort of stablisation might have helped. Overall I don''t think this is a very appealing image. I am assuming that these are bar taps, perhaps it sould have been a stronger image to just show on tap and even a shilouetted profile of the barman pouring a beer. I hope you don''t think that I''m being too harsh but I have only given you a two for this image, it  really doesn''t hold much interest or appeal for me. Good Luck, Todd. 2.', '2004-04-22 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(681664, 70448, 15920, '<td valign="top">He is slightly too well lit to be a real silhouette.  Complaints aside, I think the shutter speed must have been pretty good, as I think that level of drumstick movement is just about right, and everything else is sharp enough.</td>', 'He is slightly too well lit to be a real silhouette.  Complaints aside, I think the shutter speed must have been pretty good, as I think that level of drumstick movement is just about right, and everything else is sharp enough.', '2004-04-22 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(681666, 70579, 15920, '<td valign="top">Like the idea that the subject is not silhoutted, and that the sky is perfectly blown out.  Subject is positioned well, off center, but not formulatically in the tradition ROT positions.</td>', 'Like the idea that the subject is not silhoutted, and that the sky is perfectly blown out.  Subject is positioned well, off center, but not formulatically in the tradition ROT positions.', '2004-04-22 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(681669, 70626, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great place, perfect time of day to take this shot, and you got a fair bit of cooperation from the sky.  "Good on you"! -8</td>', 'Great place, perfect time of day to take this shot, and you got a fair bit of cooperation from the sky.  "Good on you"! -8', '2004-04-22 18:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(681671, 70916, 15920, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out the silhoutte on this monitor.</td>', 'I can''t make out the silhoutte on this monitor.', '2004-04-22 18:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(681728, 70948, 11738, '<td valign="top">That background is way too edited for my taste.  Colours are nice and vibrant, but it all feels a bit fake.</td>', 'That background is way too edited for my taste.  Colours are nice and vibrant, but it all feels a bit fake.', '2004-04-22 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(681730, 70719, 11738, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  Too bad about the tree though.  Really like the two people included in the shot and and the halo effect caused by the sun.</td>', 'Sweet.  Too bad about the tree though.  Really like the two people included in the shot and and the halo effect caused by the sun.', '2004-04-22 19:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(681734, 70931, 11738, '<td valign="top">That looks like so much fun!</td>', 'That looks like so much fun!', '2004-04-22 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(681737, 70937, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent title</td>', 'Excellent title', '2004-04-22 19:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(681809, 70566, 20577, '<td valign="top">Wow, this should be a painting!</td>', 'Wow, this should be a painting!', '2004-04-22 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(681835, 70828, 2158, '<td valign="top">This works really well as a silhouette, but I''m wondering what it would have looked like in landscape mode.  I''d have likes to see a bit more background; more negative space.</td>', 'This works really well as a silhouette, but I''m wondering what it would have looked like in landscape mode.  I''d have likes to see a bit more background; more negative space.', '2004-04-22 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(681838, 70503, 2158, '<td valign="top">It takes amazing timing to get a shot like this.  Well done.</td>', 'It takes amazing timing to get a shot like this.  Well done.', '2004-04-22 20:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(681844, 70302, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo! A 10 from me.<br/></td>', 'This is a beautiful photo! A 10 from me.', '2004-04-22 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(681845, 70201, 16230, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!</td>', 'I love the colors!', '2004-04-22 21:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(681847, 70934, 16230, '<td valign="top">Way cool image! Show this to the drivers--they''ll love it.</td>', 'Way cool image! Show this to the drivers--they''ll love it.', '2004-04-22 21:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(681854, 70570, 2158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  There is just enough cloud in the sky to make it interesting.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  There is just enough cloud in the sky to make it interesting.', '2004-04-22 21:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(681909, 70846, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I''m not sure it''s right for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice, but I''m not sure it''s right for this challenge.', '2004-04-22 21:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(681910, 70370, 12311, '<td valign="top">Ah... right from the 70s.  Very nice!</td>', 'Ah... right from the 70s.  Very nice!', '2004-04-22 21:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(681913, 70828, 12311, '<td valign="top">I like the subdued color and haze in this.  Meets the challenge very well.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'I like the subdued color and haze in this.  Meets the challenge very well.  Nicely done. 8', '2004-04-22 21:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(681916, 70802, 12311, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt, but wish you hadn''t cut off the top of your subject''s head.  Otherwise, color and composition are very well done.  7</td>', 'I like the tilt, but wish you hadn''t cut off the top of your subject''s head.  Otherwise, color and composition are very well done.  7', '2004-04-22 22:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(681919, 70206, 12311, '<td valign="top">I have a weakness for trees... Nice one!  7</td>', 'I have a weakness for trees... Nice one!  7', '2004-04-22 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(682003, 70919, 19966, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of background color. I also like the way you used the gradient especially in a self "portrait". It adds a sensual note in what it seems to say about the subject. The focus is very clear, too.</td>', 'Nice choice of background color. I also like the way you used the gradient especially in a self "portrait". It adds a sensual note in what it seems to say about the subject. The focus is very clear, too.', '2004-04-22 23:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(682004, 70925, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful greyscale with nice tonal range. The clouds take your breath away. This should be in the hunt for a ribbon.</td>', 'Wonderful greyscale with nice tonal range. The clouds take your breath away. This should be in the hunt for a ribbon.', '2004-04-22 23:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(682007, 70889, 19966, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-04-22 23:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(682014, 70341, 19966, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful shot. The detail is amazing and I like the angle of the ship pointing away from the viewer.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful shot. The detail is amazing and I like the angle of the ship pointing away from the viewer.', '2004-04-22 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(682018, 70746, 20608, '<td valign="top">I love this photo</td>', 'I love this photo', '2004-04-22 23:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(682019, 70782, 20231, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, I think it would make an awesome framed work in someone''s house or office.  Great work.  If I could vote, I''d give you a 10!</td>', 'I love this photo, I think it would make an awesome framed work in someone''s house or office.  Great work.  If I could vote, I''d give you a 10!', '2004-04-22 23:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
