(683024, 70946, 806, '<td valign="top">I wonder if there is too much going on here. the silouette of the cactus should be more than enough to be the subject. The tangle of the tree on the right adds too much chaos. Including it also creates a space in the middle of the frame. My eye goes to the left, to the right and back and forth... but not in a pleasing pattern.</td>', 'I wonder if there is too much going on here. the silouette of the cactus should be more than enough to be the subject. The tangle of the tree on the right adds too much chaos. Including it also creates a space in the middle of the frame. My eye goes to the left, to the right and back and forth... but not in a pleasing pattern.', '2004-04-23 21:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
