(683141, 70951, 12268, '<td valign="top">there are a lot of statue shots in this challenge &amp; find this to be the best. Love the bg with the clouds &amp; beautiful blue sky. The glare from the sun on the angel''s(?) wings is very appropriate. Not sure about the title but that is inconsequential. Nice work here. the only thing I see that could improve this is that there seems to be a dark glow around the subject that is infintestimally discerning. 8</td>', 'there are a lot of statue shots in this challenge & find this to be the best. Love the bg with the clouds & beautiful blue sky. The glare from the sun on the angel''s(?) wings is very appropriate. Not sure about the title but that is inconsequential. Nice work here. the only thing I see that could improve this is that there seems to be a dark glow around the subject that is infintestimally discerning. 8', '2004-04-23 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
