(683458, 70302, 13035, '<td valign="top">This might win a ribbon.  One of my favorites.  I might spend the extra time to remove the sticks or leaves that are floating in the water under the highest bird.  Also to right there looks like a couple specs of digital noise.  Just a great shot.  Good luck! 9</td>', 'This might win a ribbon.  One of my favorites.  I might spend the extra time to remove the sticks or leaves that are floating in the water under the highest bird.  Also to right there looks like a couple specs of digital noise.  Just a great shot.  Good luck! 9', '2004-04-24 07:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
