(684060, 70627, 17551, '<td valign="top">I used to live on a street called silhouette drive! Nicely done shot, i like the purple hue.</td>', 'I used to live on a street called silhouette drive! Nicely done shot, i like the purple hue.', '2004-04-25 00:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(684061, 70265, 17551, '<td valign="top">seems a little grainy &amp; out of focus... intentional?</td>', 'seems a little grainy & out of focus... intentional?', '2004-04-25 00:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(684076, 70931, 6388, '<td valign="top">Galloping bareback?  I''m impressed.  anyway I''m sure you''ll get knocked by other because there''s still some detail in the horse/girl.  I think it''s still clearly in the spriit of the challenge, and is a great image.  I might have cropped it so that there was a little more space in front of the horse.  movement  can be blocked by centre crops like this sometimes.  love the catchlights in the mane/tail/hair.  a little burning of the sky might bring some detail back in the blown out parts of the trees too (but that''s nit-picking i know).  She will love this one when she''s older :)<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Galloping bareback?  I''m impressed.  anyway I''m sure you''ll get knocked by other because there''s still some detail in the horse/girl.  I think it''s still clearly in the spriit of the challenge, and is a great image.  I might have cropped it so that there was a little more space in front of the horse.  movement  can be blocked by centre crops like this sometimes.  love the catchlights in the mane/tail/hair.  a little burning of the sky might bring some detail back in the blown out parts of the trees too (but that''s nit-picking i know).  She will love this one when she''s older :) Pedro', '2004-04-25 01:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(684102, 70566, 16862, '<td valign="top">If this picture doesn´t win, then there´s something very wrong with the voting. It´s just perfect,   hard to believe it´s real</td>', 'If this picture doesn´t win, then there´s something very wrong with the voting. It´s just perfect,   hard to believe it´s real', '2004-04-25 01:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
