(684213, 70858, 14614, '<td valign="top">the hair blowing adds such a great sense of movement to the shot. the clouds look like metal -- well done</td>', 'the hair blowing adds such a great sense of movement to the shot. the clouds look like metal -- well done', '2004-04-25 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(684214, 70846, 14614, '<td valign="top">this shot grew on me.  very subtle silhouettes here -- you''ve used a great sky to fill the frame and set the stage</td>', 'this shot grew on me.  very subtle silhouettes here -- you''ve used a great sky to fill the frame and set the stage', '2004-04-25 09:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
