(684237, 70302, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colors. 10</td>', 'Lovely composition and colors. 10', '2004-04-25 10:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(684238, 70912, 6870, '<td valign="top">Unique gradation here of light. Very nicely framed and cropped. 10</td>', 'Unique gradation here of light. Very nicely framed and cropped. 10', '2004-04-25 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(684240, 70566, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very clever! I like! The sillhouette goes so nicely here. Nice placement of sun! 10</td>', 'Very clever! I like! The sillhouette goes so nicely here. Nice placement of sun! 10', '2004-04-25 10:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(684241, 70298, 6870, '<td valign="top">Gentle, wonderful, clear image! 10</td>', 'Gentle, wonderful, clear image! 10', '2004-04-25 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(684243, 70573, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is just tremendous. Wow. Great gradation of light. Nice point of view, too. 10</td>', 'This is just tremendous. Wow. Great gradation of light. Nice point of view, too. 10', '2004-04-25 10:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(684245, 70946, 6870, '<td valign="top">This shot has so much going for it. The contrast in silhouettes from bush to saguaro, the nice way the light comes through the branches. Very nice work. You may want to experiment with how much space is above the cactus. It seems just a tad crowded to me--or perhaps just a bit more negative space? Lovely shot! 9</td>', 'This shot has so much going for it. The contrast in silhouettes from bush to saguaro, the nice way the light comes through the branches. Very nice work. You may want to experiment with how much space is above the cactus. It seems just a tad crowded to me--or perhaps just a bit more negative space? Lovely shot! 9', '2004-04-25 10:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(684246, 70802, 6870, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate some of your artistic choices here: the cropping of the head, the tilt of the horizon, and I certainly enjoy the way the light moves around in the foreground.</td>', 'I can appreciate some of your artistic choices here: the cropping of the head, the tilt of the horizon, and I certainly enjoy the way the light moves around in the foreground.', '2004-04-25 10:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(684249, 70481, 17851, '<td valign="top">Great Photo!!! good luck ;)</td>', 'Great Photo!!! good luck ;)', '2004-04-25 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(684274, 70724, 16126, '<td valign="top">With this effect, I always have a feeling it''s been done to cover up a technically flawed picture. Don''t know if that''s the case here, can''t judge that with the excessive filter.</td>', 'With this effect, I always have a feeling it''s been done to cover up a technically flawed picture. Don''t know if that''s the case here, can''t judge that with the excessive filter.', '2004-04-25 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(684275, 70639, 16126, '<td valign="top">Not much movement here because of the composition with the silhouette smack in the middle. Don''t like DOF much: either have both the silhouette and the flag sharp, or have the flag much more out of focus.</td>', 'Not much movement here because of the composition with the silhouette smack in the middle. Don''t like DOF much: either have both the silhouette and the flag sharp, or have the flag much more out of focus.', '2004-04-25 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(684277, 70486, 16126, '<td valign="top">Cropping out the rather large dark foreground (or maybe even the building, making it a square picture) would improve I think. Color of the sky is nice.</td>', 'Cropping out the rather large dark foreground (or maybe even the building, making it a square picture) would improve I think. Color of the sky is nice.', '2004-04-25 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(684279, 70701, 16126, '<td valign="top">I can see what effect you were after, but it doesn''t come out at all, the entire picture is way too dark.</td>', 'I can see what effect you were after, but it doesn''t come out at all, the entire picture is way too dark.', '2004-04-25 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(684282, 70568, 16126, '<td valign="top">The background distracts from the silhouette, should have used smaller DOF. If you would have had her turn her shoulders and head more to the right and hips to the left, you would have gotten a darker dress and more detail in her face. Right now I feel really sorry I can''t see her face!</td>', 'The background distracts from the silhouette, should have used smaller DOF. If you would have had her turn her shoulders and head more to the right and hips to the left, you would have gotten a darker dress and more detail in her face. Right now I feel really sorry I can''t see her face!', '2004-04-25 11:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(684305, 70646, 16982, '<td valign="top">Now that is very well timed.</td>', 'Now that is very well timed.', '2004-04-25 11:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(684307, 70858, 16982, '<td valign="top">Very good sky and silhouette, but could the lines in the background be a bit more horizontal?</td>', 'Very good sky and silhouette, but could the lines in the background be a bit more horizontal?', '2004-04-25 12:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(684348, 70626, 8760, '<td valign="top">This is one of the greatest pics ! You achieved to keep details even in the shadow... This is a 10 for me !</td>', 'This is one of the greatest pics ! You achieved to keep details even in the shadow... This is a 10 for me !', '2004-04-25 13:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(684352, 70802, 8760, '<td valign="top">I give it an 8, because of the head cut....would have been a 10 otherwise !</td>', 'I give it an 8, because of the head cut....would have been a 10 otherwise !', '2004-04-25 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
