(684581, 70667, 18897, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot with all the vertical bars being so sharp, they make a nice texture. The trees in the background are perfect side-kicks and you can''t get more on-topic than this. Good cropping!</td>', 'This is a really great shot with all the vertical bars being so sharp, they make a nice texture. The trees in the background are perfect side-kicks and you can''t get more on-topic than this. Good cropping!', '2004-04-25 18:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(684584, 70503, 14211, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection</td>', 'I really like the reflection', '2004-04-25 18:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(684585, 70834, 18897, '<td valign="top">I think your picture would have gained from some detail in the subjects. Since there is no forground/background for them to interact with in any way and the edges being so sharp, they seem a bit cut-out of the picture rather than being silhouettes.</td>', 'I think your picture would have gained from some detail in the subjects. Since there is no forground/background for them to interact with in any way and the edges being so sharp, they seem a bit cut-out of the picture rather than being silhouettes.', '2004-04-25 18:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
