(684592, 70783, 18897, '<td valign="top">Very nice bird and high marks in another challenge, but in my oppinion you''re a bit off the silhouettes with this one; way too much detail and light on the front. Sorry.</td>', 'Very nice bird and high marks in another challenge, but in my oppinion you''re a bit off the silhouettes with this one; way too much detail and light on the front. Sorry.', '2004-04-25 18:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(684595, 70915, 18897, '<td valign="top">Nothing really happening here. This image signals end of challenge week and panic for silhouette shot? Good thing the hair blows out a bit in the front or it would have looked very painted. Something tells me a lot more detail was visible before PS kicked in..</td>', 'Nothing really happening here. This image signals end of challenge week and panic for silhouette shot? Good thing the hair blows out a bit in the front or it would have looked very painted. Something tells me a lot more detail was visible before PS kicked in..', '2004-04-25 18:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
