(684738, 69943, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and cropping/framing. I like the position of the horses in the frame and the angle of the light. I do wish it were just a bit lighter behind the horses, though.</td>', 'Lovely composition and cropping/framing. I like the position of the horses in the frame and the angle of the light. I do wish it were just a bit lighter behind the horses, though.', '2004-04-25 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(684743, 70931, 6870, '<td valign="top">She ran callin'' ''Wiiiiiiildfire.'' (from the song?) She looks like she''s having fun! And bare back to boot! I like the mood and feel in this photo. I do wish it were a bit lighter directly behind the horse and girl, and you might try framing/cropping so that the horse has more room in front of its face to ''run''. Nice work.</td>', 'She ran callin'' ''Wiiiiiiildfire.'' (from the song?) She looks like she''s having fun! And bare back to boot! I like the mood and feel in this photo. I do wish it were a bit lighter directly behind the horse and girl, and you might try framing/cropping so that the horse has more room in front of its face to ''run''. Nice work.', '2004-04-25 21:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(684747, 70724, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and tones here. I love the placement of the dog in the frame--and its shadow. It looks very processed. If you look closely, you can see a little grid pattern from the pixels, which may  indicate doing to much to it or cropping/enlarging it too much.</td>', 'Very nice colors and tones here. I love the placement of the dog in the frame--and its shadow. It looks very processed. If you look closely, you can see a little grid pattern from the pixels, which may  indicate doing to much to it or cropping/enlarging it too much.', '2004-04-25 21:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(684748, 70382, 6870, '<td valign="top">The perfect road-trip car! I like the scenery here, and the sillhouette makes that guy a bit more symbolic.</td>', 'The perfect road-trip car! I like the scenery here, and the sillhouette makes that guy a bit more symbolic.', '2004-04-25 21:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(684749, 70958, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun capture! That little bird''s head is framed just right by those leaves. I wish he were in focus, though.</td>', 'Fun capture! That little bird''s head is framed just right by those leaves. I wish he were in focus, though.', '2004-04-25 21:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(684751, 70265, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors and very effective composition. the portrait mode works well for this image. I do wish the tree were in sharper focus, though.</td>', 'Pretty colors and very effective composition. the portrait mode works well for this image. I do wish the tree were in sharper focus, though.', '2004-04-25 21:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(684786, 70858, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the color scheme whether natural or artificial; strong diagonal composition with the hill and the hair forming nice parallels. Maybe a little halo on the lower hills, but a minor detail.</td>', 'I like the color scheme whether natural or artificial; strong diagonal composition with the hill and the hair forming nice parallels. Maybe a little halo on the lower hills, but a minor detail.', '2004-04-25 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(684789, 70610, 1031, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little over-sharp, with noticable halos; might work a bit better if the bird was over to the right a bit.</td>', 'Maybe a little over-sharp, with noticable halos; might work a bit better if the bird was over to the right a bit.', '2004-04-25 22:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
