(684884, 70911, 11813, '<td valign="top">I like your treee in the foreground, in relation to the smaller trees and mountainous region in the background. Natural, without over saturating the colors... yes, I like it!<br/></td>', 'I like your treee in the foreground, in relation to the smaller trees and mountainous region in the background. Natural, without over saturating the colors... yes, I like it!', '2004-04-25 23:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(684887, 70828, 11813, '<td valign="top">You have / had a great idea here. Next time you visit this place (if it''s a local place for you?), either kneel down or find a lower plane from which to take the photograph.... you''ll then have the mountains framed INSIDE the gazebo, in a way that would be more pleasing to the eye. Nicely seen.</td>', 'You have / had a great idea here. Next time you visit this place (if it''s a local place for you?), either kneel down or find a lower plane from which to take the photograph.... you''ll then have the mountains framed INSIDE the gazebo, in a way that would be more pleasing to the eye. Nicely seen.', '2004-04-25 23:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(684888, 70201, 11813, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colors and nice composition. It''s a shame there isn''t more to see of the water reflections, this tight horizontal format almost teases the eyes... which want to see more! :-)</td>', 'Very beautiful colors and nice composition. It''s a shame there isn''t more to see of the water reflections, this tight horizontal format almost teases the eyes... which want to see more! :-)', '2004-04-25 23:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(684889, 70738, 11813, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice silhouette... I''m just not a fan of center comnposed subjects. Maybe it''s just a personal preference thing for me?</td>', 'It''s a nice silhouette... I''m just not a fan of center comnposed subjects. Maybe it''s just a personal preference thing for me?', '2004-04-25 23:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(684891, 70610, 5391, '<td valign="top">My only 10 of the challenge.  Silhouettes can be used so effectively in conjunction with a minimalist composition and you''ve really played that to your advantage.  The wires are placed perfectly in the frame to keep balance and the bird''s silhouette is very sharp and perfectly sideways.  This is a really great shot!</td>', 'My only 10 of the challenge.  Silhouettes can be used so effectively in conjunction with a minimalist composition and you''ve really played that to your advantage.  The wires are placed perfectly in the frame to keep balance and the bird''s silhouette is very sharp and perfectly sideways.  This is a really great shot!', '2004-04-25 23:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(684892, 70702, 11813, '<td valign="top">I like the image and I like your silhouette. I think it''s a personal preference thing but, for some reason my mind wants to see the fisherman on the left side facing the right Maybe it''s because human beings are accustomed to reading left to right?<br/>Nice capture.</td>', 'I like the image and I like your silhouette. I think it''s a personal preference thing but, for some reason my mind wants to see the fisherman on the left side facing the right Maybe it''s because human beings are accustomed to reading left to right?Nice capture.', '2004-04-25 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(684895, 70953, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  You''ve used the silhouettes and high contrast to create an excellent mood that sets this photo apart.  Very nice crop and composition.  9</td>', 'Excellent shot.  You''ve used the silhouettes and high contrast to create an excellent mood that sets this photo apart.  Very nice crop and composition.  9', '2004-04-25 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(684898, 70626, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great use of silhouettes and lighting to really play the unusual rock formations in the picture.  The clouds add a lot of drama, making this very eye-catching.  Beautiful shot.  9</td>', 'Great use of silhouettes and lighting to really play the unusual rock formations in the picture.  The clouds add a lot of drama, making this very eye-catching.  Beautiful shot.  9', '2004-04-25 23:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(684899, 70546, 11813, '<td valign="top">Well, this certainly is a silhouette shot and appropriate for the theme. I am usually drawn to these types of silhouettes (human form) but for some reason your image is missing something......  I just can''t figure out what that "something" is ? Maybe if the head were turned slightly sideways so we could make out a face profile it would help, I don''t know?  Thank you for sharing this with us.</td>', 'Well, this certainly is a silhouette shot and appropriate for the theme. I am usually drawn to these types of silhouettes (human form) but for some reason your image is missing something......  I just can''t figure out what that "something" is ? Maybe if the head were turned slightly sideways so we could make out a face profile it would help, I don''t know?  Thank you for sharing this with us.', '2004-04-25 23:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(684900, 70858, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Spectacular clouds, perfect composition, and I love the sharpness of the silhouetted ground and figure.  The hair blowing in the wind really gives it that little extra something.  9</td>', 'Beautiful.  Spectacular clouds, perfect composition, and I love the sharpness of the silhouetted ground and figure.  The hair blowing in the wind really gives it that little extra something.  9', '2004-04-25 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(684901, 70546, 17551, '<td valign="top">good pose, if I would change anything it would be to lower the brightness a small amount. Great shot. 9</td>', 'good pose, if I would change anything it would be to lower the brightness a small amount. Great shot. 9', '2004-04-25 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(684902, 70719, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great use of the tiny figures to add perspective to this monument.  I especially love the sharpness of the image, and the dynamic composition really adds strength to the shot.  Nice work.  9</td>', 'Great use of the tiny figures to add perspective to this monument.  I especially love the sharpness of the image, and the dynamic composition really adds strength to the shot.  Nice work.  9', '2004-04-25 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(684904, 69936, 11813, '<td valign="top">Your image had / has great potential. THe problem for me is, I''m having a hard time making out part of the silhouette. I can''t tell if they are facing front or back or, where the child on the right side''s head has gone? :-)  It''s a nice silhouette, with nice sunset colors. If you could do it again, I''d try to work on making sure both children''s heads are visible against the sun in the back.</td>', 'Your image had / has great potential. THe problem for me is, I''m having a hard time making out part of the silhouette. I can''t tell if they are facing front or back or, where the child on the right side''s head has gone? :-)  It''s a nice silhouette, with nice sunset colors. If you could do it again, I''d try to work on making sure both children''s heads are visible against the sun in the back.', '2004-04-25 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(684906, 70652, 17551, '<td valign="top">its a very two-tone shot, and I just cant see any clear outline detail. I like the pure blackness of the tree.</td>', 'its a very two-tone shot, and I just cant see any clear outline detail. I like the pure blackness of the tree.', '2004-04-25 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(684907, 70206, 17551, '<td valign="top">magnificent cloud &amp; sky colours, and the white streak is great. 8 from me.</td>', 'magnificent cloud & sky colours, and the white streak is great. 8 from me.', '2004-04-25 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(684908, 70904, 5391, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a neon sign?  Perhaps if the composition wasn''t so centered it might be more visually appealing.  As it is, I really prefer the shots in the challenge that used a light source from behind to create a silhouette of an object, rather than just seeing the outline created by the sign.</td>', 'This appears to be a neon sign?  Perhaps if the composition wasn''t so centered it might be more visually appealing.  As it is, I really prefer the shots in the challenge that used a light source from behind to create a silhouette of an object, rather than just seeing the outline created by the sign.', '2004-04-25 23:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(684911, 70925, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like the title.. and there is something really appealing about this shot. Perhaps its the interesting clouds or the uniform rock pier.. I''m not sure. But I like it. 8</td>', 'I like the title.. and there is something really appealing about this shot. Perhaps its the interesting clouds or the uniform rock pier.. I''m not sure. But I like it. 8', '2004-04-25 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
