(684921, 70745, 17551, '<td valign="top">For me, the border distracts from this wonderful image. 7</td>', 'For me, the border distracts from this wonderful image. 7', '2004-04-25 23:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(684930, 70684, 17551, '<td valign="top">awesome colours, and clouds are stunning. 10 from me.</td>', 'awesome colours, and clouds are stunning. 10 from me.', '2004-04-25 23:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(684931, 70734, 17551, '<td valign="top">You probably get comments about the powerlines in the foreground, but I like them, and the fact they are uniform works. 8</td>', 'You probably get comments about the powerlines in the foreground, but I like them, and the fact they are uniform works. 8', '2004-04-25 23:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(684933, 70732, 10084, '<td valign="top">Excellent details of the shapes of the spiders and the fly. The bold contrast gives the composition a dynamic feeling. Spiders seem to be moving. I like the graduation in the background really helps to make the subjects stand out. "10"<br/></td>', 'Excellent details of the shapes of the spiders and the fly. The bold contrast gives the composition a dynamic feeling. Spiders seem to be moving. I like the graduation in the background really helps to make the subjects stand out. "10"', '2004-04-25 23:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(684934, 70626, 17551, '<td valign="top">fellow aussie.. Nice pic too :-).. 9</td>', 'fellow aussie.. Nice pic too :-).. 9', '2004-04-25 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(684936, 70610, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great simple composition makes this shot very interesting. The great background of the sky really helps to make the silhouette of the bird stand out. One thing that IMHO may make it even better is cropping out the bottom power/telephone line. It would give a better balance.</td>', 'Great simple composition makes this shot very interesting. The great background of the sky really helps to make the silhouette of the bird stand out. One thing that IMHO may make it even better is cropping out the bottom power/telephone line. It would give a better balance.', '2004-04-25 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(684940, 70858, 17551, '<td valign="top">Quite stunning.. 10</td>', 'Quite stunning.. 10', '2004-04-25 23:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(684951, 70836, 1031, '<td valign="top">A very unusual treatment of this flower.</td>', 'A very unusual treatment of this flower.', '2004-04-26 00:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(684957, 70814, 1031, '<td valign="top">They DO have a distinctive profile!</td>', 'They DO have a distinctive profile!', '2004-04-26 00:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(684966, 70734, 9232, '<td valign="top">There are two distracting red lights in the bottom lefthand corner and two black, vertical lines in the bottom righthand corner.  Like the color tones and the strong silhouetted image.</td>', 'There are two distracting red lights in the bottom lefthand corner and two black, vertical lines in the bottom righthand corner.  Like the color tones and the strong silhouetted image.', '2004-04-26 00:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(684967, 70840, 1031, '<td valign="top">Even though it might not have been as "realistic" a depiction, I''d be mighty tempted to move the two figures closer and crop to a square, to make it look even more like the classic "faces or vases" illusion.</td>', 'Even though it might not have been as "realistic" a depiction, I''d be mighty tempted to move the two figures closer and crop to a square, to make it look even more like the classic "faces or vases" illusion.', '2004-04-26 00:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(684968, 70927, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hey that''s the address (if not location) where I grew up -- cool find.</td>', 'Hey that''s the address (if not location) where I grew up -- cool find.', '2004-04-26 00:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(684971, 70616, 9232, '<td valign="top">Intense use of lines and right angles in this composition.  The bird, by contrast (please pardon the pun), stands out as organic.  Since you already have one incongruous entity in the composition (the bird) I find the red lights and the numbers at the bottom third to be a little much.  Without the organic subject''s silhouette I think those would provide a strong interest point against the backdrop of the black and white.  Overall still an above average shot.</td>', 'Intense use of lines and right angles in this composition.  The bird, by contrast (please pardon the pun), stands out as organic.  Since you already have one incongruous entity in the composition (the bird) I find the red lights and the numbers at the bottom third to be a little much.  Without the organic subject''s silhouette I think those would provide a strong interest point against the backdrop of the black and white.  Overall still an above average shot.', '2004-04-26 00:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(684976, 70951, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interestingly, you have a bit of a dark halo around your angel ... I''m wondering if it''s intended that way.</td>', 'Interestingly, you have a bit of a dark halo around your angel ... I''m wondering if it''s intended that way.', '2004-04-26 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(684977, 70599, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great sky and colors, nice subtlety to the sillouettes.  I think though some more "shapes" in the forms would have added to this (just a general comment about choice of subject -- I know there''s nothing you could have done about the shapes of the mountain/ridge range)</td>', 'Great sky and colors, nice subtlety to the sillouettes.  I think though some more "shapes" in the forms would have added to this (just a general comment about choice of subject -- I know there''s nothing you could have done about the shapes of the mountain/ridge range)', '2004-04-26 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(684980, 70546, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see the feminine form here even though there''s little detail.  The pose is good, except maybe the position of the head--I''m not sure I am correctly seeing the way she is facing.  I think however that the centered approach is not dynamic enough here.</td>', 'I like how you can see the feminine form here even though there''s little detail.  The pose is good, except maybe the position of the head--I''m not sure I am correctly seeing the way she is facing.  I think however that the centered approach is not dynamic enough here.', '2004-04-26 00:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(684981, 70749, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent lightling, original subject for this challenge. I don''t know if I like the assortment in a lineup like that -- I think I''d either use two the same and one different, or maybe put the shorter one noticably in front to add some depth and purpose to the differences.</td>', 'Excellent lightling, original subject for this challenge. I don''t know if I like the assortment in a lineup like that -- I think I''d either use two the same and one different, or maybe put the shorter one noticably in front to add some depth and purpose to the differences.', '2004-04-26 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(684982, 70931, 9232, '<td valign="top">I''m not terribly fond of the reddish cast that I perceive on my monitor but that''s just a matter of taste.  You cropped this composition well and you''ve managed to convey the action of both horse and rider.  Good, solid darks on most of the horse''s body and while some of the rider''s tones stand out more she (?) can be more easily selected against the background.  Good job.</td>', 'I''m not terribly fond of the reddish cast that I perceive on my monitor but that''s just a matter of taste.  You cropped this composition well and you''ve managed to convey the action of both horse and rider.  Good, solid darks on most of the horse''s body and while some of the rider''s tones stand out more she (?) can be more easily selected against the background.  Good job.', '2004-04-26 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(684983, 70566, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done and the idea to base it on classical art is excellent here.</td>', 'Well done and the idea to base it on classical art is excellent here.', '2004-04-26 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(684985, 69939, 9232, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if you''d cropped the upper tree out of the frame and made it much more of a horizontal shot from the dark ground up into the pinkish section of the sky just above the palm trees.  Just my take on it.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if you''d cropped the upper tree out of the frame and made it much more of a horizontal shot from the dark ground up into the pinkish section of the sky just above the palm trees.  Just my take on it.', '2004-04-26 00:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(684986, 70724, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great effect on this shot.  From my point of view I see this more as a shadow than a silhouette.  The only real difference is whether I''m stading in the subject''s shadow or off to the side but here it just doesn''t seem to me to be a silhouette.  Love the shot, though.</td>', 'Great effect on this shot.  From my point of view I see this more as a shadow than a silhouette.  The only real difference is whether I''m stading in the subject''s shadow or off to the side but here it just doesn''t seem to me to be a silhouette.  Love the shot, though.', '2004-04-26 00:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(684990, 70945, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting sillouettes; I think the flower in the foreground is an interesting idea but its so bright and dominent that it''s distracting here.  Gives it more of a montage feel.</td>', 'Interesting sillouettes; I think the flower in the foreground is an interesting idea but its so bright and dominent that it''s distracting here.  Gives it more of a montage feel.', '2004-04-26 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(684991, 70929, 9232, '<td valign="top">I wish you could have cloned out the power lines in the bottom right third.  Gorgeous composition and coloring.  I like the tones you captured here.</td>', 'I wish you could have cloned out the power lines in the bottom right third.  Gorgeous composition and coloring.  I like the tones you captured here.', '2004-04-26 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(684992, 70928, 9232, '<td valign="top">Appears to be an odd artifact in the bush or smaller tree.</td>', 'Appears to be an odd artifact in the bush or smaller tree.', '2004-04-26 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(684993, 70639, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute idea; well done except the flag is somewhat overexposed on the left.  I think it might have been better without centering the soldier as well.</td>', 'Cute idea; well done except the flag is somewhat overexposed on the left.  I think it might have been better without centering the soldier as well.', '2004-04-26 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(684996, 70799, 9232, '<td valign="top">This shot just feels like it has too much action to me.  Selecting just a few branches and zooming in might have given a clearer message from my perspective.</td>', 'This shot just feels like it has too much action to me.  Selecting just a few branches and zooming in might have given a clearer message from my perspective.', '2004-04-26 00:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(684997, 70833, 9232, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  I think you executed it well, too.  To me it would have had more impact had you extended your negative space more to the sides rather than top to bottom.  The effect produced (IMO) would have been to reinforce the horizontal aspect of your silhouetted subject.  I like the placement you selected in the composition.</td>', 'I like this idea.  I think you executed it well, too.  To me it would have had more impact had you extended your negative space more to the sides rather than top to bottom.  The effect produced (IMO) would have been to reinforce the horizontal aspect of your silhouetted subject.  I like the placement you selected in the composition.', '2004-04-26 00:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(684998, 70573, 9232, '<td valign="top">My personal favorite of the whole challenge.  Great idea and superb execution.  I hope you share your settings and post-production work on this shot.</td>', 'My personal favorite of the whole challenge.  Great idea and superb execution.  I hope you share your settings and post-production work on this shot.', '2004-04-26 00:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(685000, 70758, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but seems too overprocessed (USM I think or some other filter, and sky color.)</td>', 'Interesting, but seems too overprocessed (USM I think or some other filter, and sky color.)', '2004-04-26 00:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(685001, 70714, 9232, '<td valign="top">I like this effect here with the silhouette of the cliff jutting out into the water and the colored blossoms overlaying it in the foreground.  Very nice.  I think this would have had just a little more impact to me if it had been cropped in on the left side just a little to remove the distracting edges of that bush in the lower left corner and if the bottom had been cropped up just a little.  This, IMO, would help to center the story of the dark cliff silhouette as a background for the nearer, colored blossoms.  I think that is the strength of this shot as a silhouette.  As just a location shot the whole thing works to make me want to visit.</td>', 'I like this effect here with the silhouette of the cliff jutting out into the water and the colored blossoms overlaying it in the foreground.  Very nice.  I think this would have had just a little more impact to me if it had been cropped in on the left side just a little to remove the distracting edges of that bush in the lower left corner and if the bottom had been cropped up just a little.  This, IMO, would help to center the story of the dark cliff silhouette as a background for the nearer, colored blossoms.  I think that is the strength of this shot as a silhouette.  As just a location shot the whole thing works to make me want to visit.', '2004-04-26 00:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(685002, 70803, 12253, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t see any sillouettes here.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t see any sillouettes here.', '2004-04-26 00:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(685003, 70295, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is so cool, the water spray is awesome...great one.</td>', 'That is so cool, the water spray is awesome...great one.', '2004-04-26 00:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(685005, 70437, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting--wonder if that''s a statue?  In any case, I think it contrasts nicely with the sky, and the trees, I find the lighter ground more distracting though.  I would have loved to see a crop or composition with just the trees and the moose (upper portion is fine)</td>', 'Interesting--wonder if that''s a statue?  In any case, I think it contrasts nicely with the sky, and the trees, I find the lighter ground more distracting though.  I would have loved to see a crop or composition with just the trees and the moose (upper portion is fine)', '2004-04-26 00:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(685006, 70935, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very sexy...well done.</td>', 'Very nice, very sexy...well done.', '2004-04-26 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(685011, 70946, 1031, '<td valign="top">Is that cactus really flipping us off? :)</td>', 'Is that cactus really flipping us off? :)', '2004-04-26 00:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(685013, 70566, 772, '<td valign="top">This is great work and I would have loved to see a blue ribbon on it :)</td>', 'This is great work and I would have loved to see a blue ribbon on it :)', '2004-04-26 01:02:11.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(685014, 70503, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congrats Sally!</td>', 'Congrats Sally!', '2004-04-26 01:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(685015, 70503, 10167, '<td valign="top">Congratulations...  This was a GREAT pic!</td>', 'Congratulations...  This was a GREAT pic!', '2004-04-26 01:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(685016, 70642, 13440, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on another Ribbon, Manuel!</td>', 'Congratulation on another Ribbon, Manuel!', '2004-04-26 01:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(685017, 70503, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  What''s not to like.  Congrats!!!<br/>Grayce</td>', 'Beautiful!  What''s not to like.  Congrats!!!Grayce', '2004-04-26 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(685019, 70642, 10167, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!  Very nice picture!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!  Very nice picture!', '2004-04-26 01:04:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(685020, 70302, 10167, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!  It was well deserved!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!  It was well deserved!', '2004-04-26 01:06:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(685022, 70573, 9668, '<td valign="top">The light is diffused by a normal piece of printing paper. A lamp is behind that, givining it the circle of light. Taken with my Sony Mavica, macro, in a studio type of setup.<br/>I thank you all for you comments and votes, this a PR (Personal Record) for my highest finishing and highest scoring image yet, very exciting.</td>', 'The light is diffused by a normal piece of printing paper. A lamp is behind that, givining it the circle of light. Taken with my Sony Mavica, macro, in a studio type of setup.I thank you all for you comments and votes, this a PR (Personal Record) for my highest finishing and highest scoring image yet, very exciting.', '2004-04-26 01:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(685024, 70503, 10437, '<td valign="top">WOW, Sally, fantastic, one of my 10''s<br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'WOW, Sally, fantastic, one of my 10''sCongratulations!', '2004-04-26 01:07:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(685025, 70503, 714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image here.  Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful image here.  Congrats!', '2004-04-26 01:07:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(685027, 70642, 714, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  I could look at this all day.  Congrats!</td>', 'This is awesome.  I could look at this all day.  Congrats!', '2004-04-26 01:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(685029, 70503, 9964, '<td valign="top">congrats on a wonderful picture! :)</td>', 'congrats on a wonderful picture! :)', '2004-04-26 01:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(685031, 70302, 714, '<td valign="top">Dancing in the sunlight.  This is a great capture! congrats!</td>', 'Dancing in the sunlight.  This is a great capture! congrats!', '2004-04-26 01:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(685034, 70626, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, I didn''t get to vote on this shot, but if I did I would have given it a 10 for sure.  Lovely image.  I would hang this on my wall!</td>', 'Wow, I didn''t get to vote on this shot, but if I did I would have given it a 10 for sure.  Lovely image.  I would hang this on my wall!', '2004-04-26 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(685035, 70642, 6870, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Manuel, you are a true artist!</td>', 'Brilliant. Manuel, you are a true artist!', '2004-04-26 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(685039, 70307, 7778, '<td valign="top">Very strong, balanced shot with a nice range of contrast, both in mood and light. Looks like four seasons in two minutes. :-)<br/> <br/>The inclusion of the road adds much, IMHO.</td>', 'Very strong, balanced shot with a nice range of contrast, both in mood and light. Looks like four seasons in two minutes. :-) The inclusion of the road adds much, IMHO.', '2004-04-26 01:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(685042, 70931, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, Crab!  Sweet shot.  I would never think of you taking a picture like this.  Great shot. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Wow, Crab!  Sweet shot.  I would never think of you taking a picture like this.  Great shot. One of my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(685044, 70503, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really just beautiful.   It''s always a challenge to capture a moment that''s really out of your control - and you captured this one wonderfully!   Congratulations on you first place win!</td>', 'This is really just beautiful.   It''s always a challenge to capture a moment that''s really out of your control - and you captured this one wonderfully!   Congratulations on you first place win!', '2004-04-26 01:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(685051, 70626, 13440, '<td valign="top">Thanks again for all voters  :D<br/>I actually got a lot more silhouette from this place but I wasn''t so sure which one is the best. I''ve chosen this one and 5th place is good enough I reckon...<br/> <br/>You can see more here <a href="//www.pbase.com/dinn/12_apostles" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/dinn/12_apostles</a> <br/> <br/>Thanks all!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-26 00:16:42.</i></td>', 'Thanks again for all voters  :DI actually got a lot more silhouette from this place but I wasn''t so sure which one is the best. I''ve chosen this one and 5th place is good enough I reckon... You can see more here //www.pbase.com/dinn/12_apostles  Thanks all!', '2004-04-26 01:14:44.000000', '2004-04-26 01:16:42.000000', 0),
(685054, 70642, 16479, '<td valign="top">amazing shot, manny....bilib na talaga ko sa''yo...</td>', 'amazing shot, manny....bilib na talaga ko sa''yo...', '2004-04-26 01:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(685068, 70935, 16703, '<td valign="top">you did it again man... awesome stuff...it deserved higher ranking in my opinion but oh well...</td>', 'you did it again man... awesome stuff...it deserved higher ranking in my opinion but oh well...', '2004-04-26 01:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(685072, 70710, 19966, '<td valign="top">I was absolutely sure this would be in the top three -- first actually. What a stunning shot.</td>', 'I was absolutely sure this would be in the top three -- first actually. What a stunning shot.', '2004-04-26 01:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(685095, 70642, 16301, '<td valign="top">lol I knew it was you! I really love your work, congrats on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>Keep it up...</td>', 'lol I knew it was you! I really love your work, congrats on the ribbon. Keep it up...', '2004-04-26 01:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(685104, 70503, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really great work, Sally! Wow! Told ya!</td>', 'Really great work, Sally! Wow! Told ya!', '2004-04-26 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(685107, 70302, 6870, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah. I knew this was going somewhere. Very fine work! Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Oh yeah. I knew this was going somewhere. Very fine work! Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2004-04-26 01:36:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(685112, 70858, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey Heida, I sure wish you''d leave comments and let us in on your secrets! Wonderful work here again!</td>', 'Hey Heida, I sure wish you''d leave comments and let us in on your secrets! Wonderful work here again!', '2004-04-26 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(685116, 70268, 8891, '<td valign="top">I am very bummed out that this did not do better, René.  It was one of only two tens I gave in this challenge.  The 2 and the threes are totally unwarranted.  Best of luck!   RoB</td>', 'I am very bummed out that this did not do better, René.  It was one of only two tens I gave in this challenge.  The 2 and the threes are totally unwarranted.  Best of luck!   RoB', '2004-04-26 01:37:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(685130, 70642, 6349, '<td valign="top">My top pick for the challenge.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'My top pick for the challenge.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(685132, 70566, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great work labuda.  Great to see your photography doing so well.  So close to getting your ribbons back.  I''m sure you''ll have plenty very soon.  Gave this a 10.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'Great work labuda.  Great to see your photography doing so well.  So close to getting your ribbons back.  I''m sure you''ll have plenty very soon.  Gave this a 10.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(685136, 70626, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I love the close up of the 12 Apostles!  This was one of my favorite photos in the challenge.  I was looking forward to finding out where it was taken.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'Wow.  I love the close up of the 12 Apostles!  This was one of my favorite photos in the challenge.  I was looking forward to finding out where it was taken.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(685139, 70858, 6349, '<td valign="top">Top photo as usual.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'Top photo as usual.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:49:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(685140, 70566, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Imagineer:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t believe this is a Michelangelo actually!  ;)<br/> <br/>Nice take and well shot. Thumb on the right looks artificially large though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It''s from the Sistine Chapel:<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//spider.ipac.caltech.edu/staff/gerard/old_web_page/sistine.jpg'', strrpos(''//spider.ipac.caltech.edu/staff/gerard/old_web_page/sistine.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//spider.ipac.caltech.edu/staff/gerard/old_web_page/sistine.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>Although technically, it doesn''t depict the creation of Adam, but rather the point at which he is imbued with life or soul or whatever ... if God had ever done that before you could call him the Re-Animator ....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-26 00:53:44.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Imagineer: I don''t believe this is a Michelangelo actually!  ;) Nice take and well shot. Thumb on the right looks artificially large though.  It''s from the Sistine Chapel:  Although technically, it doesn''t depict the creation of Adam, but rather the point at which he is imbued with life or soul or whatever ... if God had ever done that before you could call him the Re-Animator ....', '2004-04-26 01:50:20.000000', '2004-04-26 01:53:44.000000', 0),
(685142, 70573, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo Zoomsak.  Proud to add it to my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful photo Zoomsak.  Proud to add it to my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(685144, 70745, 6349, '<td valign="top">This image is perfect.  One of my top picks for the challenge.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'This image is perfect.  One of my top picks for the challenge.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(685145, 70702, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'Wonderful work.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-26 01:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
