(685278, 70295, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lol<br/>Greetings from the Critique Club<br/>Funny I should get your image, because I just critiqued one of you images a few challenges ago. Well here it goes:<br/> <br/>Composition: Possibly a little more space at the top and a little less at the bottom, but it is only minor. A little tilt may have helped as well.<br/> <br/>Technical: Although it is a silhouettes challenge the sand and first wave seem a bit dark. Slightly less DOF or a lot of manuel blurring in the background would make the subject stand out a bit more.<br/> <br/>Overall: AWSOME skimboarding picture. Great action capture. I love the splash, I love the frozen subject midair. I think this may have done a bit better if the subject was more silhouetted. Excellent job</td>', 'LolGreetings from the Critique ClubFunny I should get your image, because I just critiqued one of you images a few challenges ago. Well here it goes: Composition: Possibly a little more space at the top and a little less at the bottom, but it is only minor. A little tilt may have helped as well. Technical: Although it is a silhouettes challenge the sand and first wave seem a bit dark. Slightly less DOF or a lot of manuel blurring in the background would make the subject stand out a bit more. Overall: AWSOME skimboarding picture. Great action capture. I love the splash, I love the frozen subject midair. I think this may have done a bit better if the subject was more silhouetted. Excellent job', '2004-04-26 03:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(685282, 70503, 16636, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot - a totally deserved win - congratulations...</td>', 'Fantastic shot - a totally deserved win - congratulations...', '2004-04-26 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(685289, 70295, 1031, '<td valign="top">The subject is a complete silhouette, with less than 10% lit from the back (right), just enough to give shape/dimension. Great action shot! I was trying to remember if that was called a skimboard ... I haven''t seen a real one in a long time ...</td>', 'The subject is a complete silhouette, with less than 10% lit from the back (right), just enough to give shape/dimension. Great action shot! I was trying to remember if that was called a skimboard ... I haven''t seen a real one in a long time ...', '2004-04-26 03:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
