(685562, 70570, 16780, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments &amp; for helping me hit my best placement to date! :o)<br/>To answer one question, the orange area on the bottom to the far left is the covered front porch archway &amp; the others are windows.  The building does have more windows, but none of them have a counter window to show straight through.  Too many walls in between them.<br/>This is Fire Island Lighthouse on Long Island.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments & for helping me hit my best placement to date! :o)To answer one question, the orange area on the bottom to the far left is the covered front porch archway & the others are windows.  The building does have more windows, but none of them have a counter window to show straight through.  Too many walls in between them.This is Fire Island Lighthouse on Long Island.', '2004-04-26 10:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(685566, 70616, 11457, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly rich, I think it deserved to be way higher. I like the contrast between the rather simple<br/>lines in the top half and the complex tapestry of wires and metal in the bottom half.  And I love the<br/>color of wires and those two little red light!</td>', 'This is incredibly rich, I think it deserved to be way higher. I like the contrast between the rather simplelines in the top half and the complex tapestry of wires and metal in the bottom half.  And I love thecolor of wires and those two little red light!', '2004-04-26 10:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(685583, 70302, 19608, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your kind comments.  What a treat to get a ribbon so soon (my 3rd challenge!)  I wonder how long it will take to repeat.  Many thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks all for your kind comments.  What a treat to get a ribbon so soon (my 3rd challenge!)  I wonder how long it will take to repeat.  Many thanks again.', '2004-04-26 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
