(1084097, 70626, 17507, '<td valign="top">I actually think the version of this picture that you have on your website is much better. In that version with the looser crop, I get a much greater sense of depth and space. Bringing the bright rays of sun further down into the composition helps keep the visual interest well away from the edge, with is a problem with the one you entered for the challenge.<br/> <br/>The one you entered here is cool, but the one on your website is amazing.</td>', 'I actually think the version of this picture that you have on your website is much better. In that version with the looser crop, I get a much greater sense of depth and space. Bringing the bright rays of sun further down into the composition helps keep the visual interest well away from the edge, with is a problem with the one you entered for the challenge. The one you entered here is cool, but the one on your website is amazing.', '2004-12-31 07:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
